1
00:00:02,570 --> 00:00:08,450
{\an2}（A24影业）

2
00:00:12,620 --> 00:00:15,830
{\an2}（纽约中央影业）

3
00:00:16,660 --> 00:00:17,870
{\an8}（九码半）

4
00:00:19,790 --> 00:00:20,750
{\an8}（八码半）

5
00:00:29,910 --> 00:00:31,880
- 玛丽安太太 - 是九码半的吗？
- Mrs. Mariann. - You have the nine and a half?

6
00:00:31,890 --> 00:00:33,950
- 是的 可给你找到了 - 太好了
- Yeah, you're a lucky lady. - Oh, I'm excited.

7
00:00:33,960 --> 00:00:36,250
最后一双了 来 露个玉足吧
Last pair. Let me see those beautiful feet.

8
00:00:35,430 --> 00:00:37,680
{\an8}（美国 纽约）

9
00:00:38,250 --> 00:00:39,910
右脚还可以吧？
The right foot's all right?

10
00:00:39,920 --> 00:00:41,980
来 用力伸进去
There you go. Get it in there.

11
00:00:42,420 --> 00:00:44,750
- 太小了 - 加油 加油
- They're too tight. - It's okay. All right.

12
00:00:44,770 --> 00:00:46,830
- 这真是九码半？ - 对 九码半
- Are these the nine and a half? - These are the nine and a half, yeah.

13
00:00:46,840 --> 00:00:48,720
- 有大一号的吗？ - 唯独这牌子没有
- Do you have the next size? - No, not in a Kerrybrooke.

14
00:00:48,730 --> 00:00:50,550
所以我不推荐凯步轩
But that's why I don't like Kerrybrooke,

15
00:00:50,570 --> 00:00:53,030
穿他们鞋 跟裹小脚一样
because they fit really small. They're made for dolls or something.

16
00:00:53,040 --> 00:00:55,920
- 太不合脚了 - 好吧 脱下来吧 脱下来吧
- They're too tight. - Okay, take 'em off. Don't worry about it.

17
00:00:55,930 --> 00:00:57,520
- 穿过朝阳吗？ - 没有
- You ever try Vitality? - No.

18
00:00:57,540 --> 00:00:59,800
- 这牌子档次更高 更耐穿 - 稍等一下
- It's a much better model if you want durable leather. - I'll be right with you.

19
00:00:59,820 --> 00:01:01,370
- 打扰了 - 拿来试试吧
- Excuse me. Sorry. - I'll try it.

20
00:01:01,380 --> 00:01:04,140
我要找前几天卖我鞋的 戴眼镜的那位
I bought a pair of shoes here the other day from him, with the glasses.

21
00:01:04,150 --> 00:01:05,350
- 马蒂 - 怎么了？
- Marty. - Yeah?

22
00:01:05,360 --> 00:01:08,520
有位顾客找你 前几天是你卖她鞋吗？
This woman said she bought a pair of shoes from you.

23
00:01:08,540 --> 00:01:10,590
哦 对 是买了那双棕色玛丽珍吧
Oh, yeah. You bought the brown Mary Janes, right?

24
00:01:10,610 --> 00:01:12,230
- 没错 鞋挺好的 - 合脚吗？
- Yeah, I did. They're great. - How do they fit you?

25
00:01:12,240 --> 00:01:13,980
- 我当时穿着就走了 - 好
- I wore them out of the store. - Okay.

26
00:01:13,990 --> 00:01:16,550
- 然后旧鞋就落在这里了 - 旧鞋长什么样？
- So I left my old ones here. - Okay. What did they look like?

27
00:01:16,570 --> 00:01:18,450
拼色高跟鞋 带小翅膀图案
They're two-toned pumps, wingtips.

28
00:01:18,470 --> 00:01:20,370
- 洛伊 有见到那鞋吗？ - 没有
- Lloyd, did you see her shoes? - No.

29
00:01:20,390 --> 00:01:23,200
不会被你们装回我没拿走的鞋盒
Is it possible that you maybe put them in one of the boxes of the other shoes

30
00:01:23,220 --> 00:01:25,600
然后又塞回库房了吧？
that I was trying on and restocked them?

31
00:01:25,620 --> 00:01:27,740
- 好吧... - 要是看见鞋盒 我就能认出来
- Okay. All right. Um... - If I saw the boxes, I'd be able to recognize it.

32
00:01:27,750 --> 00:01:29,740
让我同事来帮您选购好吗？
Do you mind if my colleague helps you out for a second?

33
00:01:29,750 --> 00:01:31,900
洛伊 你帮忙接待一下这位行吗？
Lloyd. Can you help with Mariann here?

34
00:01:31,910 --> 00:01:32,990
没问题 等下
Sure. Sure.

35
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:35,960
- 走 跟我去仓库 - 谢谢 借过
- Yeah, we'll check the basement. Come. - Thank you. Excuse me.

36
00:01:35,970 --> 00:01:38,880
- 洛伊会拿来朝阳的 - 好吧 我得考虑下价格
- Lloyd's gonna help you. Get the Vitalities. - Okay. I'll think about the price.

37
00:01:38,890 --> 00:01:41,680
- 您先坐会儿 我马上就来 - 好的 谢谢
- I'll be right with you. Let me finish up here. - Okay, thank you.

38
00:01:41,700 --> 00:01:43,260
- 怎么了？ - 嘘
- What? - Shh.

39
00:01:44,690 --> 00:01:46,100
- 是马蒂吧？ - 是 真倒霉
- Marty. - Ah, fuck.

40
00:01:46,110 --> 00:01:47,430
给你看个东西 进来一下
I wanna show you something. Come here.

41
00:01:47,450 --> 00:01:49,610
- 什么？ - 蹲下 赶紧蹲下
- What? - Just get low. Go low.

42
00:01:49,630 --> 00:01:51,710
我干嘛非得蹲着啊
Why do I have to get low?

43
00:01:53,060 --> 00:01:55,620
- 忙吗？ - 马蒂 瞧瞧我给你准备的
- How you doing? - Marty, look what I got for ya.

44
00:01:55,640 --> 00:01:56,880
什么东西？
What is this?

45
00:01:57,160 --> 00:01:58,160
仔细瞧瞧
Check it out.

46
00:01:58,220 --> 00:01:59,760
{\an8}（诺金鞋行 家用鞋履 经久耐穿）

47
00:01:59,280 --> 00:02:00,760
有啥特别的？
What am I looking at?

48
00:02:00,770 --> 00:02:02,070
看看背面
Turn it over.

49
00:02:03,100 --> 00:02:04,600
{\an8}（马蒂·毛瑟 管事）

50
00:02:04,560 --> 00:02:06,000
- 做管事？ - 对 管事
- Manager? - Manager.

51
00:02:06,020 --> 00:02:07,030
得了吧 老默
Come on, Murray.

52
00:02:07,050 --> 00:02:08,930
不管怎样 别告诉洛伊就行
Whatever you do, just don't tell Lloyd about this.

53
00:02:08,950 --> 00:02:11,450
我不是不尊重你 但把话讲明白
Look, I've been very clear with you. I'm not...

54
00:02:11,460 --> 00:02:13,660
这店子你经营得确实不错
trying to be disrespectful. You built something very commendable here.

55
00:02:13,670 --> 00:02:16,200
现在别 别谈这些
I don't wanna-- I don't wanna discuss this now.

56
00:02:16,220 --> 00:02:18,170
别打断我 让我说完
Stop. Stop. Let me say something.

57
00:02:18,190 --> 00:02:20,490
这活确实让我学到不少
It's been good for my soul to see this up close and personal.

58
00:02:20,500 --> 00:02:23,070
- 但我不是来卖鞋的 - 我不想听这些
- But I'm not a shoe salesman. - I don't wanna discuss this.

59
00:02:23,090 --> 00:02:25,590
- 我不是这块料 - 别扯这些 行吗？
- I'm not a shoe salesman. - I don't wanna discuss this, okay?

60
00:02:25,600 --> 00:02:27,760
必须谈 等我飞回来 我就不干了
I do wanna discuss it, 'cause when I'm back from my trip, this is over.

61
00:02:27,770 --> 00:02:29,000
我不可能留在这行
I'm not coming back and doing this.

62
00:02:29,020 --> 00:02:30,970
说到这 工钱现在能结吗 我得去买机票
Speaking of which, can we settle up now? I gotta buy my plane ticket.

63
00:02:30,990 --> 00:02:32,010
打烊再结
We'll settle at closing.

64
00:02:32,020 --> 00:02:33,520
我得趁午休去买票
I wanted to see the travel agent on my lunch break.

65
00:02:33,540 --> 00:02:35,280
你拿到钱肯定不回来了
You'll never come back after your lunch break.

66
00:02:35,300 --> 00:02:37,240
你真把我看成那种人？
That's what you think of me?

67
00:02:37,250 --> 00:02:39,110
- 对 - 你真以为我会跑了不回来吗？
- Yes. - You think I would go and not come back?

68
00:02:39,120 --> 00:02:40,790
对 我说了打烊再结 行吗？
Yes. I said settle at closing, okay?

69
00:02:40,810 --> 00:02:42,720
- 就这样？ - 对 就这样 出去吧
- That's it? - Yeah, that's it. Goodbye.

70
00:02:42,740 --> 00:02:43,940
你可真会疼人
I love you.

71
00:02:45,490 --> 00:02:47,240
- 快点 - 等我一下
- Come on. - Wait. Just wait for me.

72
00:02:57,880 --> 00:03:01,590
- 我本来就...正要去你家的 - 啥？
- I was about... I was about to come to you. - What?

73
00:03:02,220 --> 00:03:03,810
不行 艾勒在家病着呢
No, Ira's home sick.

74
00:03:03,830 --> 00:03:05,480
- 喂喂喂 什么病 别传染给我 - 什么？
- Whoa, whoa, whoa. I can't get sick. - What?

75
00:03:05,500 --> 00:03:06,690
我得去打锦标赛 我可不能病
I got the championships.

76
00:03:06,710 --> 00:03:09,570
不是 他是吃坏肚子了 只是吃坏肚子了
No, it's food poisoning. It's food poisoning.

77
00:03:33,190 --> 00:03:35,690
真想把你塞进行李箱带走
I wish I could hide you in my luggage.

78
00:03:37,470 --> 00:03:39,680
我也好想跟你走
I wanna come with you so bad.

79
00:03:55,190 --> 00:03:58,810
{\an7}♪ 趁还有机会 跳起来吧 ♪
♪ Let's dance in style, let's dance for a while ♪

80
00:03:58,820 --> 00:04:02,270
{\an7}♪ 别靠天命 活在当下吧 ♪
♪ Heaven can wait, we're only watching the skies ♪

81
00:04:02,280 --> 00:04:05,330
{\an7}♪ 盼着好事 也做好最坏打算 ♪
♪ Hoping for the best but expecting the worst ♪

82
00:04:05,350 --> 00:04:08,270
{\an7}♪ 明天会不会就烟消云散？ ♪
♪ Are you gonna drop the bomb or not? ♪

83
00:04:09,170 --> 00:04:12,540
{\an7}♪ 要么痛快地死 要么好好活下去 ♪
♪ Let us die young or let us live forever ♪

84
00:04:09,310 --> 00:04:11,650
{\an6}主演
提莫西·查拉梅

85
00:04:12,550 --> 00:04:16,120
{\an7}♪ 命靠天定 但我们偏要逆流而上 ♪
♪ We don't have the power but we never say never ♪

86
00:04:16,130 --> 00:04:19,760
{\an7}♪ 潮来潮去 人生苦短啊 ♪
♪ Sitting in a sandpit, life is a short trip ♪

87
00:04:17,200 --> 00:04:19,700
{\an4}主演
格温妮斯·帕特洛

88
00:04:19,770 --> 00:04:22,390
{\an7}♪ 能懂这歌的人 也懂我的伤 ♪
♪ The music's for the sad men ♪

89
00:04:22,450 --> 00:04:25,060
{\an6}主演
敖德萨·阿锡安

90
00:04:23,180 --> 00:04:26,100
{\an7}♪ 这场竞赛会怎么收场？ ♪
♪ Can you imagine when this race is won? ♪

91
00:04:26,730 --> 00:04:30,140
{\an7}♪ 是胜利还是灭亡？ ♪
♪ Turn our golden faces into the sun ♪

92
00:04:27,820 --> 00:04:30,340
{\an4}主演
凯文·奥利里

93
00:04:30,170 --> 00:04:33,140
{\an7}♪ 我们唱着赞歌 别无选择 ♪
♪ Praising our leaders, we're getting in tune ♪

94
00:04:33,150 --> 00:04:36,360
{\an7}♪ 魔鬼弹着舞曲 逼我们起舞 ♪
♪ The music's played by the, the mad man ♪

95
00:04:33,380 --> 00:04:35,810
{\an6}主演
泰勒·奥康马

96
00:04:36,610 --> 00:04:38,090
{\an7}♪ 永远年轻 ♪
♪ Forever young ♪

97
00:04:38,100 --> 00:04:41,360
{\an4}原创译制
蒙太奇字幕组

98
00:04:38,900 --> 00:04:42,490
{\an7}♪ 我想永远年轻 ♪
♪ I want to be forever young ♪

99
