{\an7}♪ 永远年轻 ♪
♪ Forever young ♪

103
00:04:53,040 --> 00:04:56,380
{\an7}♪ 我想永远年轻 ♪
♪ I want to be forever young ♪

104
00:04:57,920 --> 00:05:01,380
{\an7}♪ 谁不想永远活着？ ♪
♪ Do you really want to live forever? ♪

