反手 反手
Backhand. Backhand.

112
00:05:16,120 --> 00:05:18,940
{\an4}演出
艾莫里·科恩

113
00:05:17,110 --> 00:05:18,360
放高球
And lob.

114
00:05:19,700 --> 00:05:20,860
正手
Forehand.

115
00:05:21,320 --> 00:05:24,090
{\an6}演出
盖札·罗里格

116
00:05:21,490 --> 00:05:22,880
- 马蒂 - 干嘛
- Marty! - What!

117
00:05:22,890 --> 00:05:24,860
- 有电话 - 跟他说我20分钟前就走了
- Phone! - Tell him I left 20 minutes ago!

118
00:05:24,870 --> 00:05:27,800
我才不当你的传声筒 自己去接那该死的电话
I'm not your goddamn messenger! Pick up the goddamn phone!

119
00:05:27,060 --> 00:05:29,810
{\an4}演出
佩恩·吉列特

120
00:05:27,810 --> 00:05:29,790
我跟不上 沃利 把白衬衫脱了
I can't. Wally, take the white shirt off.

121
00:05:29,810 --> 00:05:31,860
白球配白衬衫 看不清
I can't follow the white ball against the white shirt.

122
00:05:31,870 --> 00:05:34,720
别找借口 孬种才这样找借口
Stop it. You're a fucking sun dodger.

123
00:05:32,420 --> 00:05:34,960
{\an6}演出
桑德拉·伯恩哈德

124
00:05:34,750 --> 00:05:36,790
我孬种？怎么怕了 怕了？
Oh, yeah? I love you. I love you.

125
00:05:37,780 --> 00:05:38,860
喂
Hello?

126
00:05:38,870 --> 00:05:40,340
我是朱迪
It's Judy.

127
00:05:39,370 --> 00:05:41,970
{\an4}演出
川口功人

128
00:05:40,730 --> 00:05:42,060
怎么了 朱迪
Hi, Judy.

129
00:05:42,070 --> 00:05:43,630
你妈病得很重
Your mother, she's very sick.

130
00:05:43,640 --> 00:05:45,270
- 真的假的？ - 真的
- Okay, really? - Yes.

131
00:05:45,290 --> 00:05:47,420
她脸色苍白 满嘴胡话
She's gray in the face. She's speaking nonsense.

132
00:05:46,790 --> 00:05:49,460
{\an4}演出
拉瑞·拉索·斯洛曼

133
00:05:47,430 --> 00:05:49,290
她一直喊你 你得赶快回家一趟
She's asking for you. You should come home.

134
00:05:49,310 --> 00:05:52,530
听上去不行了 你们赶紧叫救护车吧
Sounds really bad. You should probably call an ambulance.

135
00:05:53,300 --> 00:05:55,940
{\an4}演出
卢克·曼利

136
00:05:53,350 --> 00:05:54,670
谁陪她去啊
Who's gonna go with her?

137
00:05:54,680 --> 00:05:57,200
我不知道 你这么上心 你陪她去呗
Uh, I don't know. You should probably go since you're so invested.

138
00:05:57,940 --> 00:05:59,390
等一下 别挂
Hold on a minute.

139
00:05:59,400 --> 00:06:00,480
他不吃这套
He's not buying it.

140
00:06:00,490 --> 00:06:02,200
跟他说我断气了
Just tell him I stopped breathing!

141
00:06:01,250 --> 00:06:04,960
{\an8}（至尊马蒂 美国制造）

142
00:06:02,220 --> 00:06:04,980
绝对不行 太严重了 我不能这么说
Absolutely not. That's ridiculous. I'm not saying that.

143
00:06:04,990 --> 00:06:07,180
跟他说你正急着送我去医院
Tell him you're taking me to the hospital.

144
00:06:07,200 --> 00:06:09,450
好吧 我得赶紧把她送去急诊
Okay, fine. I'll take her to the emergency room

145
00:06:09,470 --> 00:06:11,570
然后在那儿陪着 天知道要陪多久
and sit there and wait for God knows how long.

146
00:06:11,580 --> 00:06:14,250
你来负责伺候我丈夫 给他喂药
And you can come here and give my husband his medicine

147
00:06:14,260 --> 00:06:16,740
“晚上给他翻身做按摩”
and massage his feet all night long.

148
00:06:16,750 --> 00:06:18,290
“跟他说我晕倒了”
Tell him I passed out.

149
00:06:17,150 --> 00:06:19,590
{\an4}配乐
丹尼尔·洛帕汀

150
00:06:18,300 --> 00:06:21,010
- “天呐 你妈刚刚昏过去了” - 你好啊 小姑娘
- Oh, my God! Your mother, she just lost consciousness. - Hi, sweetheart.

151
00:06:21,030 --> 00:06:22,990
“你现在赶紧回家”
You've gotta come home now.

152
00:06:24,500 --> 00:06:25,600
谁啊
Hello?

153
00:06:25,620 --> 00:06:28,000
是我 饭马上好
Hi. Just give me a second.

154
00:06:30,010 --> 00:06:31,800
“朱迪 别闹了行吗”
I don't know what you want me to say, Judy.

155
00:06:31,810 --> 00:06:33,270
“我正忙着 连午饭都还没吃呢”
I'm busy. I'm on my lunch break.

156
00:06:33,290 --> 00:06:36,230
“我妈就在你旁边指挥 我都听得见”
I can hear her whispering. She's right there standing next to you.

157
00:06:36,250 --> 00:06:38,850
- “我都说她昏过去了” - “别来烦我了”
- I told you she passed out. - It's annoying me now.

158
00:06:38,870 --> 00:06:40,270
跟谁通话呢？
Who are you talking to?

159
00:06:40,280 --> 00:06:42,770
哦 没人
Oh. I'm not talking to anybody.

160
00:06:42,780 --> 00:06:45,420
朱迪一直占着电话好久了
Judy's just been tying up the line for an hour.

161
00:06:45,440 --> 00:06:47,330
我给你买了点热饭
I got you some broth.

162
00:06:46,660 --> 00:06:49,200
{\an4}剪辑
罗纳德·布隆斯坦
乔什·萨弗迪

163
00:06:50,390 --> 00:06:51,510
都凉透了
