00:13:25,580 --> 00:13:28,230
是啊 小日本也来了
Yeah. The Japs sent a team.

320
00:13:28,240 --> 00:13:29,730
出境管制呢？
What about the travel ban?

321
00:13:28,240 --> 00:13:32,040
{\an8}【1952年随盟军移交日本主权 出入境管制开始放宽】

322
00:13:29,750 --> 00:13:32,020
- 肯定解禁了 - 出境管制解除了？
- They must have lifted it. - No more travel ban?

323
00:13:32,040 --> 00:13:35,610
各位 现在把球拍翻过来 露出国旗
Okay, gentlemen, I want you to flip your paddles for me now.

324
00:13:35,630 --> 00:13:36,850
谢谢配合
Thank you very much.

325
00:13:37,220 --> 00:13:40,440
准备 一 二 三
Here we go. One. Two. Three.

326
00:13:38,740 --> 00:13:40,700
{\an7}♪ 握个手吧 ♪
♪ Shake those hands ♪

327
00:13:40,990 --> 00:13:42,200
别动
Hold it still.

328
00:13:41,510 --> 00:13:43,000
{\an7}♪ 握个手吧 ♪
♪ Shake those hands ♪

329
00:13:44,440 --> 00:13:45,790
{\an7}♪ 握手 ♪
♪ Shake hands ♪

330
00:13:44,670 --> 00:13:45,980
{\an8}（第一场）

331
00:13:47,020 --> 00:13:48,380
{\an7}♪ 握手 ♪
♪ Shake hands ♪

332
00:13:55,790 --> 00:13:57,550
马蒂·毛瑟 赛点
Match point, Mauser.

333
00:13:57,570 --> 00:14:02,630
{\an8}【赛点:率先达到者只需再得一分即可赢下整场比赛】

334
00:14:02,650 --> 00:14:10,230
{\an8}【1950年代乒乓球普遍采用每局21分制 比赛多为五局三胜】

335
00:14:19,270 --> 00:14:21,630
马蒂·毛瑟 胜出
Match, Mauser.

336
00:14:24,700 --> 00:14:28,400
你给我太多正手机会了 应该逼我打反手
You let me get to my forehand too much. Should've tried to put me in my backhand.

337
00:14:24,700 --> 00:14:28,430
{\an8}【正手/反手:在乒乓球中正手利于进攻 反手偏防守】

338
00:14:28,430 --> 00:14:30,070
远藤 得分
Point, Endo.

339
00:14:50,240 --> 00:14:52,160
远藤 得分
Point, Endo.

340
00:14:57,930 --> 00:15:00,470
- 几比几了？ - 19比4
- What's the score here? - Nineteen-four.

341
00:15:00,480 --> 00:15:03,390
- 日本人领先？ - 那日本小子在揍烂贝利
- The Japanese guy? - Japanese guy's trashing Bailey.

342
00:15:03,950 --> 00:15:05,910
他手里是什么？那是什么球拍？
What's he using? What's that paddle?

343
00:15:05,930 --> 00:15:08,180
不知道 没人见过
I don't know, mate. No one knows.

344
00:15:10,620 --> 00:15:11,990
没声音
It's silent.

345
00:15:12,010 --> 00:15:14,340
- 静得出奇 - 哇
- Like a ghost! - Wow.

346
00:15:14,880 --> 00:15:16,240
贝利 好好打
Fuck, Bailey.

347
00:15:16,260 --> 00:15:18,220
远藤 得分
Point, Endo.

348
00:15:19,170 --> 00:15:20,880
赛点
Match point.

349
00:15:30,360 --> 00:15:32,580
{\an8}（第三场）

350
00:15:32,600 --> 00:15:33,700
还剩两局
Two games.

351
00:15:40,240 --> 00:15:41,660
21比9
21-9.

352
00:15:57,290 --> 00:15:58,380
- 打得好 - 打得好 马蒂
- Great game. - Great game, Marty.

353
00:15:58,400 --> 00:16:00,070
马蒂·毛瑟 胜出
Match, Mauser.

354
00:16:16,760 --> 00:16:19,500
那些在斯德哥尔胜出的人...
The winners of the tournament at Stockholm...

355
00:16:19,520 --> 00:16:22,850
嘿 你是拉姆·塞西吧
Hey. You're Ram Sethi, right?

356
00:16:22,860 --> 00:16:24,270
抱歉 您先等会儿
Sorry, could you hold for a moment?

357
00:16:24,280 --> 00:16:26,560
- 你不介意吧？ - 请说 您有啥事？
- You don't mind? - No. Can I help you with something?

358
00:16:26,570 --> 00:16:28,810
打听个事 你们住在哪家酒店？
I was just curious, where are you staying while you're in town?

359
00:16:28,820 --> 00:16:30,770
- 这关您什么事？ - 没事
- What business is it of yours? - No.

360
00:16:30,780 --> 00:16:32,440
就是随便打听下
I'm just saying, what hotel are you staying at?

361
00:16:32,460 --> 00:16:34,860
国际乒联的官员都住丽兹酒店
All the IATT representatives are stationed at the Ritz.

362
00:16:34,870 --> 00:16:37,240
- 丽兹酒店？别人也这么说 - 对
- At the Ritz? Yeah, that's what I heard. - Yes.

363
00:16:37,250 --> 00:16:39,410
- 就这么定了 你没意见吧？ - 什么就这么定了？
- Do you think that's okay? - I don't know what you're implying.

364
00:16:39,430 --> 00:16:41,810
- 你见过我住的那地方吗？ - 有啥问题吗？
- Have you seen where they put me? - Is it a problem?

365
00:16:41,820 --> 00:16:44,990
客气说 那地方就是个狗窝
Well, with all due respect, sir, it's a dump.

366
00:16:45,010 --> 00:16:47,660
很抱歉没有让您满意
I'm so sorry it doesn't meet your high standards.

367
00:16:47,670 --> 00:16:50,490
我们这儿给所有选手都是统一标准
We offer complimentary housing to all our players, Mr. Mauser.

368
00:16:50,510 --> 00:16:52,820
您是唯一一个来这抱怨的
So far as I know, you're the only one to complain.

369
00:16:52,840 --> 00:16:54,890
你这口气 别把我当普通选手 好吗？
You're talking to me like I'm any player off the street, okay?

370
00:16:54,910 --> 00:16:57,130
我得休息好 才能赢下比赛
I need good rest so I can win the tournament.

371
00:16:57,140 --> 00:16:59,840
你很清楚美国人赢对这项运动的好处
You know perfectly well what an American win will do for the future of the sport.

372
00:16:59,860 --> 00:17:03,030
- 我就是未来桌球的代言人 - 那就向美乒协反映呗
- I'm good for table tennis, Mr. Sethi. - Appeal to the USTTA.

373
00:17:03,040 --> 00:17:05,720
美乒协有用吗？他们整个机构就那俩人
There is no USTTA. The USTTA is two guys and a desk. It doesn't exist.

374
00:17:05,730 --> 00:17:07,310
- 那就不归我管了 - 就归你管
- Well, that's not my problem. - It is your problem.

375
00:17:07,330 --> 00:17:09,600
我要住你住的那家酒店 就这么简单
I wanna stay where you're staying! That's what I need!

376
00:17:09,610 --> 00:17:12,440
您这番言论实在是太失礼了
I am finding this whole exchange really offensive.

377
00:17:12,450 --> 00:17:13,900
- 我失礼？ - 对 您失礼
- You're offended? - I am offended.

378
00:17:13,920 --> 00:17:17,760
你们才失礼呢 让明星选手住狗窝
I'm offended! You're making your star player huddle in a rat's ass!

379
00:17:18,120 --> 00:17:19,660
抱歉刚才被打断了
I'm so sorry for that interruption.

380
00:17:19,680 --> 00:17:22,530
那咱们接着说锡兰和墨西哥的事...
Um, back to Ceylon and Mexico...

381
00:17:22,540 --> 00:17:26,320
- 这酒店真不赖 肯定很贵 - 是啊 确实不错
- This is a nice hotel. Must cost a mint. - Yeah, very nice.

382
00:17:26,330 --> 00:17:28,590
是国际乒联报销的吗？
The IATT covers accommodations?

383
00:17:28,610 --> 00:17:31,940
- 明星选手才有这种待遇 - 是吗？那有多少名啊
- Only for their star players. - Is that right? How many are there?

384
00:17:31,950 --> 00:17:35,240
明星选手？不知道 听说就一个
Star players? I don't know. I haven't seen any others, so one.

385
00:17:35,250 --> 00:17:36,790
进半决赛了 紧张吗？
Any nerves, going into the semis?

386
00:17:36,810 --> 00:17:39,860
紧张？对阵克莱茨基？别闹了
Nerves? Against Kletzki? No. You kidding me?

387
00:17:40,010 --> 00:17:42,140
他曾连续三年夺冠
Well, he's won the tournament for the last three years.

388
00:17:42,160 --> 00:17:44,940
- 他名气可不小 - 我名气也不小
- He's got quite the reputation. - I have quite the reputation.

389
00:17:44,960 --> 00:17:48,850
奥斯维辛集中营都办不到的事 我要办成
Look, I'm gonna do to Kletzki what Auschwitz couldn't.

390
00:17:48,860 --> 00:17:51,030
看我怎么把他灭了
Okay. I'm gonna finish the job.

391
00:17:48,860 --> 00:17:53,070
{\an8}【奥斯维辛:纳粹设立的集中营 实施种族灭绝】

392
00:17:53,090 --> 00:17:55,580
- 天呐 - 这话有点过了
- Jesus Christ. - A little strong, mate.

393
00:17:55,600 --> 00:17:57,380
没事的 我能说 我也是犹太人
It's all right. I'm Jewish. I can say that.

394
00:17:57,400 --> 00:17:59,900
事实上你想想 我更像是希特勒的大噩梦
In fact, if you think about it, I'm like Hitler's worst nightmare.

395
00:17:59,910 --> 00:18:01,020
此话怎讲？
And why's that?

396
00:18:01,040 --> 00:18:02,910
看看我 我活得好好的
Look at me. I'm here.

397
00:18:02,920 --> 00:18:06,900
还混到了上层 我就是希特勒失败的最终证明
I did it, I'm on top. I'm the ultimate product of Hitler's defeat.

398
00:18:07,100 --> 00:18:09,580
对 把这句话记下来 都记下来
Yeah, write that down. That was good. Write that down.

399
00:18:09,590 --> 00:18:11,340
- 不错 - “希特勒失败的最终证明”
- Nice one. - "Ultimate product of Hitler's defeat."

400
00:18:11,360 --> 00:18:13,510
- 你总是那么自信吗？ -一定把那这句放在我照片下面
- Do you like that confidence? - Put that under a picture of me.

401
00:18:13,530 --> 00:18:15,950
- 来谈谈你的出身吧 - 我的出身？
- Tell us a bit about your background. - My background?

402
00:18:20,090 --> 00:18:22,970
不过说真的 我...我妈死于难产
No, but seriously... My my my mother died in childbirth.

403
00:18:22,980 --> 00:18:25,760
我爸就是个没出息的人 我两岁时他就丢下我走了
My father was a compulsive loser who abandoned me when I was two years old.

404
00:18:25,770 --> 00:18:27,520
我被纽约孤儿院来回折腾
I got stuck in the New York City orphanage system,

405
00:18:27,540 --> 00:18:29,470
到处被赶来赶去
got shuttled from one hellhole to the next.

406
00:18:29,480 --> 00:18:31,220
- 难免有了案底 - 那不是凯·斯通吗？
- Naturally, got in trouble with the law. - Isn't that Kay Stone?

407
00:18:31,240 --> 00:18:32,720
那破事可不能定义我
I don't want any of that to define me.

408
00:18:32,730 --> 00:18:34,700
采访呢 采访呢 看什么呢？
Excuse me. Excuse me. What?

409
00:18:34,720 --> 00:18:36,690
- 看凯·斯通 - 就是她
- It's Kay Stone over there. - That's her.

410
00:18:36,700 --> 00:18:37,570
谁？
Who's that?

411
00:18:37,580 --> 00:18:40,160
三十年代那阵儿的老牌女星
Well, you know, the movie actress. Like, from the 1930s.

412
00:18:40,500 --> 00:18:42,200
- 演《机缘巧合》的那个 - 《机缘巧合》?
- Opportunities. - Opportunities?

413
00:18:42,210 --> 00:18:43,700
- 演得很好 - 是啊 佳片一个
- That was good. - Yeah, yeah. Great movie.

414
00:18:43,710 --> 00:18:44,990
- 还有《黑匣子》 - 我爸特喜欢她
- Black Box. - My dad loved her.

415
00:18:45,010 --> 00:18:46,040
- 是啊 - 没错
- Yeah. - Yeah.

416
00:18:46,060 --> 00:18:47,940
- 她当年很红吗？ - 红透半边天
- She was big? - She was huge.

417
00:18:47,950 --> 00:18:49,590
后来销声匿迹了
Came and went. That's her.

418
00:18:49,600 --> 00:18:52,770
- 好莱坞就是这样 - 真是她
- That's Hollywood, mate. - Yeah. It's her.

419
00:18:53,550 --> 00:18:54,630
确实是她
It is indeed.

420
00:18:54,640 --> 00:18:56,420
还有个什么湖的电影
Something about a lake?

421
00:18:56,430 --> 00:18:58,930
- 《影湖》 - 嗯 那片也不错
- Shadow Lake. - Yeah, that was good.

422
00:18:59,250 --> 00:19:00,320
- 漂亮 - 腿不错
- Pretty. - Great legs.

423
00:19:00,340 --> 00:19:02,140
太漂亮了 太漂亮了
Gorgeous, mate. Gorgeous.

424
00:19:02,310 --> 00:19:04,000
- 她是在看我吗？ - 不是
- Think I have a chance, lads? - No.

425
00:19:04,020 --> 00:19:05,130
她肯定在看毛瑟
I think she's looking Mauser.

426
00:19:05,150 --> 00:19:06,230
好了 下个问题
Next question.

427
00:19:15,880 --> 00:19:17,020
喂
Hello?

428
00:19:17,040 --> 00:19:18,700
- 凯吗？ - 有事吗？
- Kay? - Speaking.

429
00:19:18,710 --> 00:19:21,280
嘿 我是马蒂·毛瑟 我住在皇家套房
Hey, it's Marty Mauser. I'm in the Royal Suite.

430
00:19:21,290 --> 00:19:23,150
我昨天在大堂见过你
I saw you in the lobby yesterday.

431
00:19:23,160 --> 00:19:23,860
怎么了？
Okay.

432
00:19:23,880 --> 00:19:26,570
我们互相看了一眼 当时我在接受采访
Yeah, we made eye contact. I was being interviewed.

433
00:19:27,520 --> 00:19:29,700
- 我不记得了 - 这么说吧
- I don't recall. - Well...

434
00:19:30,450 --> 00:19:31,690
我非常仰慕您
I'm a huge admirer.

435
00:19:31,700 --> 00:19:33,300
那好吧 要是没事我就挂了
Okay. Can I help you with something?

436
00:19:33,320 --> 00:19:36,220
有点事 我刚把客房餐单上每样都点了一份
Maybe. I just ordered one of everything off the room service menu.

437
00:19:36,240 --> 00:19:38,510
我一个人肯定吃不完
There's no way I'll be able to eat it all alone.

438
00:19:38,530 --> 00:19:39,710
我懂了
Ah.

439
00:19:39,870 --> 00:19:41,470
所以你想让我去你房间？
So you'd like me to come up to your room?

440
00:19:41,490 --> 00:19:44,350
- 嗯 没错 - 要不我派我丈夫去吧
- Mm-hmm. Yeah. - Perhaps I should send my husband instead.

441
00:19:44,360 --> 00:19:46,180
好啊 他来这里 我去你那里
Sure. He can come up here, and I'll come down to you.

442
00:19:46,190 --> 00:19:49,100
- 真一套套的 行了 再见 - 等等 我还想再说会儿
- Okay, wonderful. Thank you. Goodbye. - Wait. I wanna keep talking.

443
00:19:49,120 --> 00:19:50,480
说什么？
Why is that?

444
00:19:50,500 --> 00:19:52,310
我从没跟真正的电影明星说过话
Because I've never talked to an actual movie star.

445
00:19:52,320 --> 00:19:55,400
现在你说过了 希望你如愿以偿了
Well, now you have. I hope the experience was all you thought it would be.

446
00:19:55,420 --> 00:19:57,140
我其实也喜欢当焦点
You know, I'm something of a performer too.

447
00:19:57,160 --> 00:19:59,390
- 是吗？ - 是啊 你不信吗？
- Are you? - Yeah. You don't believe me?

448
00:19:59,740 --> 00:20:01,080
我...
I...

449
00:20:01,200 --> 00:20:02,960
你怎么？怎么了嘛？
You... What? What?

450
00:20:03,680 --> 00:20:04,650
你会演戏？
You're a performer?

451
00:20:04,660 --> 00:20:07,250
对 会演 你手边有《每日邮报》吗？
Yeah, I am a performer. You got the Daily Mailin front of you?

452
00:20:07,270 --> 00:20:09,410
还真有 怎么了？
Uh, I do have it. Yes?

453
00:20:09,430 --> 00:20:11,290
好的 那你翻到第12页
Okay. Well, turn to page 12.

454
00:20:14,000 --> 00:20:15,150
等下
Uh...

455
00:20:15,630 --> 00:20:16,760
第12页
Page 12.

456
00:20:16,780 --> 00:20:18,830
好了 看什么？
Okay. What am I looking at here?

457
00:20:18,840 --> 00:20:20,590
看中间 正中间
Down the middle, in the center.

458
00:20:21,530 --> 00:20:22,620
那人是你？
This is you?

459
00:20:22,630 --> 00:20:25,010
对“天选之子” 拍得不错吧？
Yeah, "the chosen one." It's a nice picture, right?

460
00:20:25,020 --> 00:20:26,100
打小乒乓的？
Ping pong?

461
00:20:25,150 --> 00:20:28,330
{\an8}（真是天选之子？）

462
00:20:26,120 --> 00:20:28,310
我打的是桌球 来这儿参加英国公开赛
I play table tennis. I'm here competing in the British Open.

463
00:20:28,330 --> 00:20:30,260
- 你多大了？ - 我23
- How old are you? - I'm 23.

464
00:20:30,270 --> 00:20:31,680
才23岁
Twenty-three.

465
00:20:31,690 --> 00:20:32,890
嗯
Yeah.

466
00:20:33,040 --> 00:20:35,650
我赌你都说不上来我演过什么吧
I bet you can't name one film I've done.

467
00:20:35,670 --> 00:20:36,820
凭啥这么肯定？
What makes you say that?

468
00:20:36,840 --> 00:20:38,660
因为我在你出生前就不演了
Because I stopped acting before you were born.

469
00:20:38,680 --> 00:20:40,480
- 是吗？有点意思 - 嗯
- Really? That's really interesting. - Mm-hmm.

470
00:20:40,490 --> 00:20:43,470
凯 你拿我的刮胡刀刮腿毛了吗？
Kay, did you use my razor to shave your legs?

471
00:20:43,480 --> 00:20:45,060
- 刀钝了 我都划伤了 - 没拿
- It's dull. I've cut myself. - No.

472
00:20:45,070 --> 00:20:46,490
- 谁在说话？你丈夫？ - 嗯
- Who's that? Your husband? - Mm-hmm.

473
00:20:46,500 --> 00:20:48,580
难不成还有人偷偷溜进来用过它？
I guess someone must've snuck in and chopped wood with it.

474
00:20:48,590 --> 00:20:49,870
- 我正打电话呢 - 天呐
- I'm on the phone. - Holy shit.

475
00:20:49,890 --> 00:20:51,630
- 跟谁打？ - 黛比
- With whom? - Debbie.

476
00:20:51,650 --> 00:20:53,000
- 黛比 - 黛比？
- Debbie. - Debbie?

477
00:20:53,020 --> 00:20:54,200
叫她少管闲事
Tell her to get a life.

478
00:20:54,210 --> 00:20:55,670
- 他走了吗？ - 嗯
- Is he gone? - Mm-hmm.

479
00:20:55,690 --> 00:20:57,010
行
Okay.

480
00:20:57,030 --> 00:20:59,020
那你为啥不演了？说说吧
So, why'd you stop acting? Let's talk about that.

481
00:20:59,040 --> 00:21:00,410
我还有事 我得挂了
You know, I really have to go.

482
00:21:00,430 --> 00:21:02,760
明天来温布利看我打球吧 你肯定会喜欢的
You must miss it, don't you? Come watch me play at Wembley tomorrow.

483
00:21:02,770 --> 00:21:03,780
我...我去不了
I... I can't.

484
00:21:03,800 --> 00:21:06,470
来吧 看看我怎么战胜世界第一
Come on. You can watch me dethrone the number one ranked player in the world.

485
00:21:06,480 --> 00:21:07,550
我没空
I'm not available.

486
00:21:07,560 --> 00:21:08,890
哦哟？你能有什么事？
Oh, yeah? What you got going on?

487
00:21:08,910 --> 00:21:12,270
有个大宣传会 我得陪我丈夫撑场子
Actually, I have a big promotional event to attend to for my husband.

488
00:21:12,290 --> 00:21:13,890
哦 好吧
Oh, okay.

489
00:21:13,910 --> 00:21:15,410
宣传什么？
What's he promoting?

490
00:21:15,430 --> 00:21:16,560
笔
Pens.

491
00:21:16,890 --> 00:21:18,680
- 卖笔？开什么玩笑 - 就是笔
- Pens? Are you serious? - Pens.

492
00:21:18,700 --> 00:21:20,490
- 写字用的笔？ - 对
- Like, writing pens? - Yes.

493
00:21:20,500 --> 00:21:22,340
他就是个卖笔的？
What, like, he's a pen salesman?

494
00:21:22,900 --> 00:21:24,500
你们怎么住得起这种套房？
How can you afford the suite you're in?

495
00:21:24,520 --> 00:21:26,570
他是罗克韦尔墨业的老板
He owns Rockwell Ink.

496
00:21:26,580 --> 00:21:27,820
哦 那好吧...
Oh. Okay. Well...

497
00:21:27,830 --> 00:21:28,830
是的
Yes.

498
00:21:29,060 --> 00:21:31,280
- 我听说过罗克韦尔墨业 - 你肯定知道
- I know Rockwell Ink. - I'm sure you do.

499
00:21:31,290 --> 00:21:32,330
好吧
Okay.

500
00:21:32,860 --> 00:21:34,530
那活动内容是什么？
Well, what's the event?

501
00:21:34,550 --> 00:21:38,750
他请了阿加莎·克里斯蒂去哈查兹书店签名售书
He's hired Agatha Christie to sign books at Hatchards.

502
00:21:34,550 --> 00:21:39,780
{\an8}【阿加莎·克里斯蒂为英国知名小说家 哈查兹为伦敦老牌书店】

503
00:21:38,760 --> 00:21:39,830
哦 哦
Ooh.

504
00:21:40,750 --> 00:21:42,040
听着就无聊
That sounds really boring.

505
00:21:42,060 --> 00:21:43,160
行了
Okay.

506
00:21:52,040 --> 00:21:54,660
哦 没完没了了
Oh, for God's sake.

507
00:21:56,200 --> 00:21:58,310
- 有完没完？ - 别挂 别挂 问你个事
- What is it? - Don't hang up, don't hang up. Just one question.

508
00:21:58,320 --> 00:22:00,070
你房间是朝街还是朝院子？
Does your room face the street or the courtyard?

509
00:22:00,080 --> 00:22:01,070
不知道
I don't know.

510
00:22:01,090 --> 00:22:03,160
直说 朝街还是院子？
Just answer the question. Is it facing the street or the courtyard?

511
00:22:03,180 --> 00:22:04,570
- 朝院子 - 好
- The courtyard. - Okay.

512
00:22:04,580 --> 00:22:06,120
去窗边看看
I need you to go to the window.

513
00:22:06,130 --> 00:22:07,460
你住几楼？
What floor are you on?

514
00:22:07,470 --> 00:22:09,040
三楼吧
I'm on the third floor, I believe.

515
00:22:09,060 --> 00:22:10,700
三楼 好 正好
Third floor. Okay, perfect.

516
00:22:10,710 --> 00:22:11,670
朝对面看看
Look across the street.

517
00:22:11,680 --> 00:22:14,470
看见对面那开窗 桌上有果盘的屋了吗？
You see the open window with a bowl of fruit on the table?

518
00:22:15,750 --> 00:22:17,730
- 看到了吗？ - 看到了
- You see it? - I do.

519
00:22:17,750 --> 00:22:21,000
看好了 我会让那果盘里凭空多出一个苹果
Here's what's gonna happen. I'm gonna make an apple appear in that bowl.

520
00:22:21,010 --> 00:22:23,650
要是我办到了 你就推掉你那场会
And if I do, you're gonna blow off your little rendezvous

521
00:22:23,670 --> 00:22:25,240
- 不 不 不 - 来看我比赛
- No, no, no. - and come watch me play.

522
00:22:25,250 --> 00:22:26,840
我不会答应任何事
I'm not agreeing to anything, no.

523
00:22:26,850 --> 00:22:28,700
你不用答应 但看好了
You don't have to agree to anything. I'm gonna do it anyway.

524
00:22:28,710 --> 00:22:29,820
看到了 一
Okay? One...

525
00:22:30,690 --> 00:22:31,700
二
two...

526
00:22:32,340 --> 00:22:33,480
三
three.

527
00:22:37,090 --> 00:22:39,510
票我留售票处 你去取
I'll leave a ticket for you at the box office.

528
00:23:03,980 --> 00:23:07,560
{\an8}（半决赛）

529
00:23:15,810 --> 00:23:19,490
马蒂·毛瑟 19比5
Mauser. Nineteen to five

530
00:23:29,320 --> 00:23:30,950
马蒂·毛瑟 得分
Point, Mauser.

531
00:23:30,970 --> 00:23:33,200
20比5
Twenty to five.

532
00:23:33,220 --> 00:23:36,830
克莱茨基整场落后两局 零局比二
Kletzki trails Mauser two games to nil.

533
00:23:37,250 --> 00:23:40,410
马蒂·毛瑟 局点兼赛点
Game and match point, Mauser.

534
00:23:37,250 --> 00:23:40,420
{\an8}【局点兼赛点:表示马蒂再得一分即可赢下整场比赛】

535
00:23:40,430 --> 00:23:42,160
- 咱们找点乐子玩玩 - 好吧
- Let's have a little fun with this one. - Okay.

536
00:23:42,170 --> 00:23:43,710
- 玩出花样来 - 收到
- Have a little fun, all right? - Gotcha.

537
00:23:44,290 --> 00:23:46,190
换克莱茨基发球
Service switches to Kletzki.

538
00:24:16,790 --> 00:24:18,460
克莱茨基 得分
Point, Kletzki.

539
00:24:24,010 --> 00:24:26,360
好的 诸位 谢谢大家 谢谢大家
Very well, gentlemen. Thank you for that. Thank you.

540
00:24:30,800 --> 00:24:33,140
克莱茨基发球 当前局分6比20
Kletzki serves 6-20.

541
00:24:33,160 --> 00:24:36,850
马蒂·毛瑟整场领先两局 两局比零
Mauser leads two games to zero.

542
00:24:36,860 --> 00:24:38,690
又是马蒂·毛瑟的赛点
Match point again for Mr. Mauser.

543
00:24:38,710 --> 00:24:40,670
再次由你发球 克莱茨基
Your service again, Kletzki.

544
00:24:45,070 --> 00:24:46,720
马蒂·毛瑟 得分
Point, Mauser!

545
00:24:48,390 --> 00:24:52,680
马蒂·毛瑟以21比6赢下此局 以三局比零赢下整场比赛
Mauser wins the game and match by 21-6. Three games to nil.

546
00:24:52,690 --> 00:24:57,640
马蒂·毛瑟进入决赛 将对阵日本选手远藤功人
Mauser's on to the finals where he will face Koto Endo of Japan.

547
00:25:00,560 --> 00:25:03,740
{\an8}（菜单）

548
00:25:01,670 --> 00:25:03,790
别去看价钱 想吃什么随便点
Get whatever you want. Don't even look at the prices, okay?

549
00:25:04,010 --> 00:25:04,880
你点什么？
What are you getting?

550
00:25:04,900 --> 00:25:07,470
我就来个威灵顿牛排和鱼子酱拼盘
I'm gonna get the Beef Wellington and the caviar tasting plate

551
00:25:07,490 --> 00:25:09,340
要点就点最贵的
because they're the most expensive items on the menu.

552
00:25:09,360 --> 00:25:12,340
我想再唠叨两句关于巡回表演队的事
Listen, I would like to keep going back a little bit about the Globetrotters.

553
00:25:12,350 --> 00:25:13,930
- 哈林篮球队那事儿？ - 对
- About the Harlem Globetrotters, again? - Yes.

554
00:25:12,350 --> 00:25:16,700
{\an8}【哈林篮球队:美国巡回表演篮球队 擅长花式竞技与表演】

555
00:25:13,950 --> 00:25:15,470
- 我跟你说过了 我不干 - 为什么？
- I told you, I'm not interested. - Why not?

556
00:25:15,490 --> 00:25:16,680
就是不想干
'Cause I don't wanna do it.

557
00:25:16,700 --> 00:25:18,390
报酬很高
It's great money.

558
00:25:18,400 --> 00:25:20,790
咱们还能环游世界 你不想去威尼斯吗？
And we will travel all over the world. Have you seen Venice?

559
00:25:20,810 --> 00:25:22,810
- 我才不会去当马戏团的中场把戏 - 悉尼呢？
- I don't wanna be doing trick shots for a halftime show - Sydney?

560
00:25:22,830 --> 00:25:24,440
- 观众上厕所时上场 - 巴塞罗那？
- while people are going to the bathroom. - Barcelona?

561
00:25:24,460 --> 00:25:25,530
真丢人 明白吗？
That's beneath me, okay?

562
00:25:25,550 --> 00:25:28,570
- 观众相当捧他们的 - 服务员在哪儿呢？
- They're treated like royalty. - Where's the waiter?

563
00:25:28,590 --> 00:25:31,100
- 我有个熟人干过这行 - 服务员
- Listen, I know people who have done this. - Excuse me.

564
00:25:31,110 --> 00:25:32,390
服务员
Excuse me.

565
00:25:32,410 --> 00:25:35,600
机会难得 咱们得把握住
It's a great opportunity. We should not miss it.

566
00:25:38,270 --> 00:25:39,520
马蒂
Marty.

567
00:25:41,680 --> 00:25:43,180
先生 请问需要帮助吗？
Yes, sir. May I help you, sir?

568
00:25:43,190 --> 00:25:44,260
可以点菜了吗？
Hi. Can we order?

569
00:25:44,270 --> 00:25:45,710
没问题 我马上去叫这桌的服务员来
Of course, sir. Let me fetch your waiter.

570
00:25:45,730 --> 00:25:47,030
- 别走 - 请说
- Hang on. - Yes.

571
00:25:47,260 --> 00:25:49,330
今晚罗克韦尔的账由我来结
Uh, I'll be taking care of the Rockwell tab tonight.

572
00:25:49,340 --> 00:25:52,140
把账记我房间上 皇家套房 马蒂·毛瑟
Put it on my room. The Royal Suite. Marty Mauser.

573
00:25:52,160 --> 00:25:54,400
- 跟他们交代清楚 是我付的账 - 明白 先生
- And make sure they know it's me, too. - I will. Leave it to me, sir.

574
00:25:54,410 --> 00:25:55,930
- 不许被回绝 - 没问题
- Don't take no for an answer. - I won't.

575
00:25:55,950 --> 00:25:58,930
- 马蒂·毛瑟 皇家套房 去告诉他们 - 好的 先生
- Marty Mauser. Royal Suite. Go tell 'em. - Will do, sir.

576
00:26:01,270 --> 00:26:03,390
行了 看着我 别往那儿瞅 看着我
Okay. Look at me. Don't look there. Look at me.

577
00:26:03,400 --> 00:26:04,890
- 罗克韦尔是谁啊 - 就个傻瓜
- Who's Rockwell? - Some bozo.

578
00:26:04,900 --> 00:26:07,270
现在看过去 别太明显 告诉我他在干啥？
Look over now. Be subtle about it. What's he doing?

579
00:26:08,150 --> 00:26:10,020
抱歉先生 他之前没来过我们酒店
He hasn't been here before, sir.

580
00:26:10,030 --> 00:26:11,020
他在看这边
He's looking at us.

581
00:26:11,040 --> 00:26:12,100
- 是吗？ - 嗯
- Really? - Yeah.

582
00:26:12,120 --> 00:26:13,610
好 继续跟我说话 别露馅
Okay, keep talking to me. Be normal.

583
00:26:13,620 --> 00:26:15,650
好吧 听我说 再考虑一下
Okay, fine. I want you to reconsider.

584
00:26:15,660 --> 00:26:17,440
我们会是绝佳组合 我想跟你搭档
We would be a great team. I wanna do this with you.

585
00:26:17,450 --> 00:26:19,360
干嘛老想着哈林篮球队？
Why are you so fixed on the Harlem Globetrotters?

586
00:26:19,370 --> 00:26:21,410
那群人干的真丢人
It's very sad what they do, okay?

587
00:26:21,430 --> 00:26:24,600
本该是顶尖的运动员却成了杂耍的小丑
Some of the premier athletes on the planet reduced to acting like circus clowns.

588
00:26:24,610 --> 00:26:25,980
再看看什么情况
What's he doing now?

589
00:26:26,000 --> 00:26:27,340
- 他正朝这桌走来 - 他来了？
- He's coming towards us. - He's coming?

590
00:26:27,360 --> 00:26:30,300
- 别紧张 表现得自然点 - 行 好的 明白
- Just be normal. Act casual. - Okay, fine. Okay.

591
00:26:34,390 --> 00:26:36,580
劳驾 我认识你吗？
Excuse me. Do I know you?

592
00:26:37,410 --> 00:26:38,600
应该不认识
I don't think so.

593
00:26:38,620 --> 00:26:40,890
你居然想请客？
And you wanna buy dinner for my entire table tonight?

594
00:26:40,910 --> 00:26:43,140
- 对 可以吗？ - 为什么？
- Yeah. Is it okay? - Why?

595
00:26:43,390 --> 00:26:44,810
什么叫为什么？我还需要理由？
What do you mean, why? Do I need a reason?

596
00:26:44,820 --> 00:26:47,230
我换个说法 你图什么？
Let me rephrase that. What do you want?

597
00:26:47,240 --> 00:26:50,180
不 我什么都不图 只是想表示点谢意
No, I don't want anything. It's just my small way of saying thank you.

598
00:26:50,190 --> 00:26:51,950
- 谢我？ - 对
- Thank you? - Yeah.

599
00:26:51,970 --> 00:26:53,380
具体谢我什么？
Thank me for what, specifically?

600
00:26:53,390 --> 00:26:54,960
谢谢您那些产品
For all your products.

601
00:26:54,970 --> 00:26:57,720
没了你们的笔 世界该怎么办？
I mean, where would we be without pens?

602
00:26:59,450 --> 00:27:01,860
你看 我有不少本事 但最得意的就是
You know, I have many talents, but the one I'm most proud of

603
00:27:01,870 --> 00:27:04,840
- 能大老远闻出屁话 - 不
- is the ability to smell bullshit from a mile away. - No,

604
00:27:04,850 --> 00:27:07,150
我说的都是真心话
I'm being completely sincere.

605
00:27:09,760 --> 00:27:12,220
- 你是哪儿人？ - 纽约人 你呢？
- Where are you from? - New York. What about you?

606
00:27:12,230 --> 00:27:14,010
也是纽约 你是做什么的？
New York too. What do you do?

607
00:27:14,020 --> 00:27:15,500
我是个职业运动员
I'm a professional athlete.

608
00:27:15,510 --> 00:27:17,600
- 真的吗 哪项运动？ - 桌上网球
- Really? What sport? - Table tennis.

609
00:27:17,620 --> 00:27:19,060
桌球？这也算运动？
Table tennis? That's a sport?

610
00:27:19,070 --> 00:27:20,980
当然算 我来参加英国公开赛的
Of course it is. I'm here competing in the British Open.

611
00:27:20,990 --> 00:27:22,300
我明天要在温布利打决赛
I'm playing at Wembley tomorrow

612
00:27:22,310 --> 00:27:24,190
对阵日本 明天赛场座无虚席
in front of a sold-out crowd in the finals against Japan.

613
00:27:24,200 --> 00:27:25,480
- 我代表美国出赛 - 等一下
- I'm here representing the United States. - Wait, wait, wait.

614
00:27:25,500 --> 00:27:28,090
日本？日本也来了？
Japan? Japan has a team here?

615
00:27:28,100 --> 00:27:30,190
- 我刚才不是说了吗 - 那出境管制呢？
- That's what I just said. - How'd they get around the travel ban?

616
00:27:30,210 --> 00:27:32,500
因为桌球在亚洲增长最快
Because table tennis is the fastest growing sport in Asia.

617
00:27:32,510 --> 00:27:34,180
在那边火得不行
It's huge over there.

618
00:27:34,190 --> 00:27:35,200
说个有意思的事
Oh, you're gonna like this.

619
00:27:35,220 --> 00:27:37,620
你知道他们怎么握拍的吗？
Do you know what they call their grip? The way they hold their rackets?

620
00:27:37,640 --> 00:27:39,580
- 不知道 - 他们管那叫直笔握拍
- No. - They call it penholder.

621
00:27:37,640 --> 00:27:40,890
{\an8}【直拍:起源日本 英文含“握笔”之意】

622
00:27:40,910 --> 00:27:41,700
那又怎样？
So what?

623
00:27:41,720 --> 00:27:43,070
你可以拿去用
You can use that.

624
00:27:43,080 --> 00:27:44,040
用来干嘛？
Use it for what?

625
00:27:44,050 --> 00:27:47,280
拿去当宣传素材 我哪知道 我又不是生意人
For an advertisement or something. I don't know, you're the business guy.

626
00:27:47,290 --> 00:27:49,490
刚才有点失礼 这位是我搭档贝拉·克莱茨基
I'm being rude. This is my associate, Béla Kletzki.

627
00:27:49,500 --> 00:27:50,670
幸会 先生
Nice to meet you, sir.

628
00:27:50,690 --> 00:27:52,880
你也是打桌球的？
I assume you're a table tennis player also?

629
00:27:52,900 --> 00:27:56,520
是的 没错 我是1935到39年的世界冠军
I am. I am. Actually, I was the World Champion from '35 to '39.

630
00:27:56,530 --> 00:27:58,170
前世界冠军 我今天把他打败了
He was the World Champion. I beat him today.

631
00:27:58,190 --> 00:27:59,890
他赢了我 他比我年轻得多
He beat me. But he's much younger than me.

632
00:27:59,910 --> 00:28:01,630
也强得多 更有天赋
I'm much better than him, much more talented.

633
00:28:01,640 --> 00:28:05,860
我看到这个纹身 你是不是进过集中营？
I can't help but notice this tattoo. You were in one of the camps, weren't you?

634
00:28:05,880 --> 00:28:08,400
奥斯威辛二号营区 没错 怎么问这个？
Auschwitz-Birkenau. Yeah. Why do you ask?

635
00:28:08,410 --> 00:28:10,920
我儿子为了解放你们付出了生命
My son lost his life liberating you.

636
00:28:13,070 --> 00:28:14,990
我深表遗憾
I'm sorry for your loss.

637
00:28:15,400 --> 00:28:17,230
我还以为是苏联人解放你们的
I thought you were liberated by the Soviets.

638
00:28:17,240 --> 00:28:18,790
- 确实是 是苏联 - 并不是美国人
- We were. It's Soviets. - It wasn't the Americans.

639
00:28:18,810 --> 00:28:21,680
不是字面意思 我儿子在太平洋战场
I didn't mean it literally. He was serving in the South Pacific.

640
00:28:21,700 --> 00:28:23,920
那他后来怎么了？
Well, what happened to him?

641
00:28:23,930 --> 00:28:25,870
还能怎么了 他被杀了
What do you mean? He was killed.

642
00:28:26,790 --> 00:28:27,940
你觉得这好笑吗？
You find that funny?

643
00:28:27,960 --> 00:28:31,910
天呐 不是 我有时一紧张就会笑
Oh, God. No, I just get nervous laughter sometimes.

644
00:28:31,920 --> 00:28:33,130
说句安慰话
If it's any consolation,

645
00:28:33,150 --> 00:28:35,720
我明天会送给他们第三颗原子弹
I'll be dropping a third atom bomb on their heads tomorrow.

646
00:28:35,740 --> 00:28:37,750
你这套安慰话 顶多忽悠你妈
Yeah, I'm sure his mother's gonna get a lot of comfort

647
00:28:37,760 --> 00:28:39,620
让她不反对你去打小乒乓
that you're playing ping pong in his honor.

648
00:28:39,640 --> 00:28:41,800
感谢您操心我家事
It's not that big of a deal, but I appreciate it.

649
00:28:41,810 --> 00:28:44,430
跟他讲讲...他以前给纳粹拆弹
Tell him-- He used to diffuse bombs for the Nazis.

650
00:28:44,450 --> 00:28:46,180
跟他讲讲那故事
Tell him the story you told me about--

651
00:28:46,190 --> 00:28:47,910
- 我那桌还有人等我 我得走了 - 别走 别走
- I've got a whole table of people waiting. - No, no, no, wait, wait.

652
00:28:47,930 --> 00:28:49,770
他会喜欢的 讲给他听
You're gonna love this story. Tell him.

653
00:28:50,560 --> 00:28:52,650
- 你想听吗？ - 不太想 但快说吧
- You wanna hear it? - Not really, but go ahead.

654
00:28:52,670 --> 00:28:54,110
别停 快说 是好故事
No, tell him. It's beautiful.

655
00:28:54,120 --> 00:28:56,010
行 那我长话短说
Okay, I'll make it quick. So...

656
00:28:56,020 --> 00:28:59,710
我进集中营被分配住处的时候
when I first got to the camp, I was put into housing.

657
00:28:59,720 --> 00:29:02,620
幸好有个军官认出我
Lucky for me, there was an officer who recognized me.

658
00:29:02,640 --> 00:29:07,320
他在1935年布拉格世锦赛上见过我
He had seen me in 1935 at the World Championships in Prague.

659
00:29:07,330 --> 00:29:10,910
那人是真心崇拜我 真心的
This guy was a real fan. I mean, a real fan, okay?

660
00:29:10,920 --> 00:29:13,810
他居然因为你会打小乒乓就让你活着？
You're telling me he let you live because you played ping pong?

661
00:29:13,820 --> 00:29:15,870
他们很佩服我的本事 没错
They respected my skills, yeah.

662
00:29:17,370 --> 00:29:21,790
于是他们教我拆圆柱高爆炸弹
So then, they taught me how to dismantle SC bombs.

663
00:29:22,140 --> 00:29:23,220
明白吗？
Okay?

664
00:29:23,240 --> 00:29:26,810
每天早上他们把我和炸弹送到营外的树林里
Each morning, they would send me into the woods with the bombs

665
00:29:26,830 --> 00:29:30,460
就算炸了也伤不到别人
on the outskirts of the camp where I could only do damage to myself.

666
00:29:33,610 --> 00:29:35,190
有一回
So one time,

667
00:29:35,880 --> 00:29:37,570
我尾随一只蜜蜂
I followed a honeybee.

668
00:29:37,590 --> 00:29:38,730
什么蜂？
A bee?

669
00:29:38,750 --> 00:29:40,350
蜜蜂
A honeybee,

670
00:29:40,370 --> 00:29:42,390
一路跟它到了蜂巢
all the way to its hive.

671
00:29:44,900 --> 00:29:46,900
然后我用烟把蜜蜂全都熏跑
And I smoked all the bees out.

672
00:29:47,990 --> 00:29:50,510
接着我把巢掰开
And then broke it open,

673
00:29:50,520 --> 00:29:54,690
我把蜂蜜抹满全身 胸口 胳膊全抹上了
and I smeared the honey all over my chest, my arms, everywhere.

674
00:29:55,000 --> 00:29:56,090
为什么？
Why?

675
00:29:56,110 --> 00:29:57,890
晚上回去后
'Cause later that night,

676
00:29:57,900 --> 00:30:02,560
我就让室友把我身上的蜜舔掉充饥
I let all my bunk mates to lick the honey off of me for nourishment.

677
00:30:20,240 --> 00:30:31,040
{\an8}（皇家套房）

678
00:31:44,400 --> 00:31:45,440
押正面
Heads.

679
00:31:44,400 --> 00:31:50,700
{\an8}【抛硬币猜中者先选“发球”或“场地” 二选一】

680
00:31:47,640 --> 00:31:49,220
- 真倒霉 - 远藤 轮到你选了
- Fuck. - Endo, choice?

681
00:31:49,230 --> 00:31:50,690
（日语）发球

682
00:31:50,710 --> 00:31:52,210
我选那边
I'll go to that side.

683
00:31:56,460 --> 00:31:59,680
{\an8}（决赛）

684
00:31:58,880 --> 00:32:00,960
- 右侧... - 加油 马蒂 加油
- On my right... - Come on, Marty! Come on!

685
00:32:00,980 --> 00:32:04,740
是美国选手马蒂·毛瑟 世界排名第二
...Marty Mauser of the United States, ranked second,

686
00:32:04,760 --> 00:32:09,310
对阵日本选手远藤功人 未列排名
versus Koto Endo of Japan, unranked.

687
00:32:09,330 --> 00:32:12,390
比赛为五局三胜
The gentlemen will battle to the best of five

688
00:32:12,400 --> 00:32:14,710
单局21分制
in games to 21 points.

689
00:32:15,410 --> 00:32:18,720
每局须至少领先两分才能取胜
Each game shall be won by at least two points.

690
00:32:19,820 --> 00:32:21,030
祝二位好运
Good luck, gentlemen.

691
00:32:19,960 --> 00:32:23,430
{\an8}（第一局）

692
00:32:22,050 --> 00:32:23,470
请保持安静
Quiet, please.

693
00:32:24,890 --> 00:32:26,430
比赛开始
All right!

694
00:32:33,970 --> 00:32:37,960
远藤 得分 1比0
Point, Endo. One-nil.

695
00:32:42,540 --> 00:32:44,420
加油 美国人
Come on, America!

696
00:32:47,360 --> 00:32:51,490
远藤 得分 2比0
Point, Endo. Two-nil.

697
00:32:53,770 --> 00:32:55,100
加油 马蒂
All right, Marty!

698
00:32:56,730 --> 00:32:57,940
加油啊 马蒂
Come on, Marty!

699
00:33:00,640 --> 00:33:03,640
远藤 得分 3比0
Point, Endo. Three-nil.

700
00:33:13,270 --> 00:33:17,190
远藤 得分 4比0
Point, Endo. Four-nil.

701
00:33:22,520 --> 00:33:24,100
加油 马蒂
Come on, Marty!

702
00:33:30,090 --> 00:33:33,930
远藤 得分 5比0
Point, Endo. Five-nil.

703
00:33:36,060 --> 00:33:38,500
换马蒂·毛瑟发球
Service switches to Mauser.

704
00:33:42,040 --> 00:33:44,390
{\an8}（局分:美国8比日本19 场分:美国零比一）

705
00:33:43,520 --> 00:33:46,110
马蒂·毛瑟 得分
Point, Mauser.

706
00:33:44,390 --> 00:33:46,340
{\an8}（局分:美国9比日本19 场分:美国零比一）

707
00:33:46,120 --> 00:33:48,790
9比19 美方发球
Nine serving 19.

708
00:33:51,010 --> 00:33:53,760
{\an8}（第二局）

709
00:34:05,210 --> 00:34:09,470
马蒂·毛瑟 得分 10比19
Point, Mauser. 10-19.

710
00:34:09,490 --> 00:34:10,570
好样的 马蒂
Okay, Marty!

711
00:34:34,990 --> 00:34:38,950
远藤 得分 20比10
Point, Endo. 20-10.

712
00:34:40,160 --> 00:34:45,420
{\an8}【局点:率先达到者只需再得一分即可赢此局】

713
00:34:40,160 --> 00:34:41,870
局点
Game point.

714
00:34:45,950 --> 00:34:47,460
快发球
Go! Serve.

715
00:35:07,860 --> 00:35:11,860
远藤 得分 21比10
Point, Endo. 21-10.

716
00:35:11,880 --> 00:35:13,820
本局远藤胜
Game, Endo.

717
00:35:14,560 --> 00:35:19,020
远藤以两局比零领先
Endo leads two games to zero.

718
00:35:20,830 --> 00:35:23,390
{\an8}（局分:美国16比日本18 场分:美国零比二）

719
00:35:21,510 --> 00:35:23,830
马蒂·毛瑟 得分
Point, Mauser.

720
00:35:23,850 --> 00:35:26,180
18比16
Eighteen-16.

721
00:35:26,710 --> 00:35:28,630
{\an8}(第三局)

722
00:35:40,100 --> 00:35:44,270
马蒂·毛瑟 得分 17比18
Point, Mauser. 17-18.

723
00:35:44,290 --> 00:35:45,570
加油 马蒂 加油
Go, Marty! Come on!

724
00:35:45,580 --> 00:35:48,250
换马蒂·毛瑟发球
Service switches to Mauser.

725
00:36:01,700 --> 00:36:03,540
该死
Fuck.

726
00:36:07,460 --> 00:36:11,170
远藤 得分 17比19
Point, Endo. 17-19.

727
00:36:26,860 --> 00:36:28,010
真见鬼了
Oh, fuck.

728
00:36:30,900 --> 00:36:35,640
远藤 得分 17比20
Point, Endo. 17-20.

729
00:36:35,660 --> 00:36:37,430
赛点
And match point.

730
00:36:44,070 --> 00:36:46,030
请安静
Quiet, please.

731
00:36:46,620 --> 00:36:49,130
请坐好 保持安静
Quiet. Settle down.

732
00:36:50,130 --> 00:36:51,870
马蒂·毛瑟发球
Your service, Mauser.

733
00:36:51,880 --> 00:36:54,020
加油啊 马蒂
Come on, Marty!

734
00:37:02,010 --> 00:37:03,270
完了
Fuck.

735
00:37:04,730 --> 00:37:06,640
不行 这是胡闹 不行
No, bullshit! No!

736
00:37:06,660 --> 00:37:09,310
现在就给我重赛 用正规硬拍
I want a rematch right now with a standard-league hard-bat!

737
00:37:06,660 --> 00:37:14,230
{\an8}【1952年孟买世锦赛 日本选手佐藤博治首次用海绵拍 并赢得男单冠军】

738
00:37:09,330 --> 00:37:10,510
这太不像话了
That is unacceptable!

739
00:37:10,520 --> 00:37:12,240
要是我装了机械臂呢？
What if I had a mechanical arm?

740
00:37:12,250 --> 00:37:14,250
要是我在球上涂胶水呢？这合规吗？
What if I put glue on the ball? Would that be kosher?

741
00:37:14,270 --> 00:37:17,440
他全场都被教练指点 这太不像话
Why, he was getting coached the entire time! That is unacceptable!

742
00:37:19,450 --> 00:37:22,800
我打的可是正经桌球 正经桌球
I play real table tennis! Real table tennis!

743
00:37:23,560 --> 00:37:24,650
胡闹啊
Unbelievable.

744
00:37:24,990 --> 00:37:26,070
胡闹啊
Unbelievable.

745
00:37:26,080 --> 00:37:28,410
本届英国公开赛冠军是...
...British Open champion from Japan...

746
00:37:28,420 --> 00:37:29,500
去死吧你
Fuck you!

747
00:37:29,520 --> 00:37:31,860
...日本选手远藤功人
...Koto Endo!

748
00:37:34,210 --> 00:37:36,670
{\an8}（日本新闻）

749
00:37:38,290 --> 00:37:42,640
{\an8}（特别报道）

750
00:37:38,290 --> 00:37:42,180
（日语）第19届英国桌球公开赛上 日本首次问鼎冠军

751
00:37:43,550 --> 00:37:45,880
（日语）这是自太平洋战争结束以来

752
00:37:45,900 --> 00:37:49,450
（日语）首位日本选手在国际赛场上夺得胜利

753
00:37:52,140 --> 00:37:54,060
（日语）获胜者为远藤功人

754
00:37:55,820 --> 00:37:58,290
（日语）这位无名的日本挑战者 他在决赛中

755
00:37:58,310 --> 00:38:02,500
（日语）以3比0的压倒性优势击败夺冠热门的美国强手

756
00:38:08,650 --> 00:38:10,870
（日语）东京十万民众涌上街头

757
00:38:10,880 --> 00:38:12,850
（日语）宛若庆典游行

758
00:38:12,860 --> 00:38:14,640
（日语）热烈欢庆他的凯旋

759
00:38:16,310 --> 00:38:20,070
（日语）远藤却以谦逊自持 愿以一名普通工匠身份回国

760
00:38:20,090 --> 00:38:22,920
（日语）而非受封为所谓英雄

761
00:38:23,020 --> 00:38:27,730
（日语）远藤16岁遭遇东京大轰炸 失去听觉

762
00:38:27,740 --> 00:38:31,380
（日语）他在无声之中磨砺感官 最终以钢铁般意志征服赛场

763
00:38:32,800 --> 00:38:36,400
（日语）如今 世界桌球的目光聚焦于我邦

764
00:38:34,680 --> 00:38:39,890
{\an8}（第23界世界桌球锦标赛）

765
00:38:36,420 --> 00:38:40,100
（日语）本年度世界锦标赛主办地已定为东京

766
00:38:40,110 --> 00:38:44,070
（日语）美国选手必将卷土重来 誓要洗刷败绩

767
00:38:44,700 --> 00:38:47,060
（日语）但远藤并非孤军奋战

768
00:38:47,070 --> 00:38:49,430
（日语）他背靠的是与他一道齐心实现民族愿望

769
00:38:49,440 --> 00:38:52,840
（日语）共怀不屈精神的八千四百万同胞

770
00:38:52,980 --> 00:38:55,750
{\an8}（完）

771
00:39:00,740 --> 00:39:03,150
{\an8}（法国 巴黎）

772
00:39:13,770 --> 00:39:15,630
（法语）您好先生 有什么需要吗？
Bonjour monsieur, Est‑ce que je peux vous aider?

773
00:39:15,640 --> 00:39:17,400
米尔顿·罗克韦尔订的桌子在哪儿？
Do you have a Milton Rockwell reservation?

774
00:39:17,420 --> 00:39:20,690
- （法语）您说什么？ - 请查下米尔顿·罗克韦尔的订位
- Excusez-moi? - Milton Rockwell reservation, please.

775
00:39:20,710 --> 00:39:21,850
（法语）您是说罗克韦尔吧？
Ah, Rockwell?

776
00:39:21,860 --> 00:39:24,130
听着 马蒂 我得亲自谢谢你
So, listen, Marty, I wanna personally thank you

777
00:39:24,140 --> 00:39:26,640
谢谢你带我接触桌球
for introducing me to table tennis.

778
00:39:27,310 --> 00:39:29,940
我压根儿没想到 这玩意能在亚洲火成那样
I had no idea what a phenomenon it was in the Asias.

779
00:39:29,950 --> 00:39:31,850
- 哦 对 对 - 尤其在日本
- Oh, yeah. I know. - And how big it is in Japan!

780
00:39:31,860 --> 00:39:33,580
我早跟你说了 火得很
That's what I was trying to tell you. It's huge.

781
00:39:33,600 --> 00:39:36,280
所以 我打算把桌球列进
So, I'm thinking of incorporating it into some of the promotional events

782
00:39:36,290 --> 00:39:38,380
秋季在那边的宣传项目里
we're gonna be doing over there in the fall.

783
00:39:38,400 --> 00:39:39,750
你准备怎么安排？
How so? What are you thinking?

784
00:39:39,770 --> 00:39:42,510
我想在世锦赛期间
What I wanna do is stage an exhibition match

785
00:39:42,530 --> 00:39:46,320
安排一场你和远藤的表演赛
around the time of the World Championships between you and Endo.

786
00:39:46,330 --> 00:39:48,260
- 嗯 - 你肯定会喜欢的
- Mmm. - I think you'd like that idea.

787
00:39:48,280 --> 00:39:49,810
我给你开个价
So I'm gonna make you an offer.

788
00:39:49,820 --> 00:39:51,690
1000美金酬劳
I'll pay you a thousand dollars.

789
00:39:49,820 --> 00:39:51,690
{\an8}【约1.2万美元 8.5万人民币 37万新台币】

790
00:39:51,700 --> 00:39:54,190
还安排你住东京帝国饭店
I'll put you up at the Imperial Hotel in Tokyo.

791
00:39:51,700 --> 00:39:54,210
{\an8}【东京帝国饭店:建于19世纪末 东京三大顶级酒店之一】

792
00:39:54,210 --> 00:39:57,010
要是你从纽约出发 还可以坐我的私人飞机
And if you're leaving from New York, I'll give you a seat on my private plane,

793
00:39:57,020 --> 00:39:59,260
让你这辈子体验一回什么叫奢华
and you'll fly in luxury for the first time in your life.

794
00:39:59,270 --> 00:40:00,650
钱的事之后再商量
Okay, we can negotiate my price later.

795
00:40:00,670 --> 00:40:02,400
但这安排是在赛前还是赛后？
But this would be before or after the tournament?

796
00:40:02,420 --> 00:40:04,200
- 赛前一周左右 - 不行 必须是赛后
- About a week before the event. - No, it's gotta be after.

797
00:40:04,220 --> 00:40:06,360
我不能在紧要关头前陪他演戏
I can't face off against the guy in public before it actually counts.

798
00:40:06,380 --> 00:40:07,890
好戏要留到关键时候
Drama is very important to me. I can't undercut the drama.

799
00:40:07,910 --> 00:40:09,310
先别纠结细节
Let's not get tied up in minutiae.

800
00:40:09,330 --> 00:40:11,470
- 我只是想知道你有没有兴趣参加 - 有啊
- I just want to find out if you're interested in participating. - Yes.

801
00:40:11,480 --> 00:40:14,150
当然有 凡是能让我露一手的机会我都不会错过
Oh, yeah. Of course. I'm interested in any opportunity to show off my talents.

802
00:40:14,160 --> 00:40:16,970
别担心 这回我一定完胜他
And you don't have to worry either, 'cause this time I'm gonna obliterate him.

803
00:40:16,980 --> 00:40:18,660
主要是球拍的问题
It's really the racket that I'm playing,

804
00:40:18,670 --> 00:40:20,290
但我保证 准能赢
but I can assure you, it's gonna be a victory.

805
00:40:20,300 --> 00:40:22,500
行了 听着 你得明白这是怎么回事
Okay, listen. I need you to understand what this thing's about.

806
00:40:22,510 --> 00:40:25,080
这不是正式比赛
This is not an official match.

807
00:40:25,090 --> 00:40:26,830
连真打都算不上
It's not even a real game.

808
00:40:26,840 --> 00:40:31,010
这是纯粹的宣传 目的就是讨好日本人
This is purely promotional, to entertain the Japanese people,

809
00:40:31,030 --> 00:40:33,930
好让他们多买我的笔 明白吗？
so they buy more of my pens, okay?

810
00:40:33,950 --> 00:40:36,710
你上去打几局 你会很亮眼
You're gonna play a few games. You're gonna be great.

811
00:40:36,720 --> 00:40:39,890
- 但别把远藤的风头给抢了 - 你让我故意输给他？
- But you can't play better than Endo. - You want me to lose?

812
00:40:41,440 --> 00:40:44,250
马蒂 给你看样东西
Marty, let me show you something.

813
00:40:45,190 --> 00:40:47,520
日本头号杂志
Biggest magazine in Japan.

814
00:40:47,530 --> 00:40:51,150
你把远藤捧成了国民英雄
You made Endo a national treasure.

