- 我正给这哥们加油呢 - 看看这是谁
- I'm giving this guy some gas. - Look who it is.

1448
01:07:10,140 --> 01:07:11,300
别玩这套!
Don't pull that shit!

1449
01:07:11,310 --> 01:07:12,770
- 你他妈设局坑我们 - 我没设局
- You fucking hustled us! - I didn't hustle anyone.

1450
01:07:12,790 --> 01:07:15,090
我认出你了 你是他妈的马蒂·毛瑟
I know who you are! You're fuckin' Marty Mauser!

1451
01:07:15,100 --> 01:07:16,590
- 冷静点 - 我就没听说过这个名字
- Relax! - I don't know who that is!

1452
01:07:16,600 --> 01:07:18,060
罗杰 住手 住手
Roger! Stop it! Stop!

1453
01:07:18,080 --> 01:07:19,820
别 别冲动 有话好说
No, relax. Relax. Relax. Relax.

1454
01:07:19,830 --> 01:07:21,270
滚出这破车
Out of the fucking car!

1455
01:07:21,290 --> 01:07:23,160
滚出这破车 你这黑鬼
Get out of the fucking car, nigger!

1456
01:07:23,170 --> 01:07:24,780
- 凭什么要我... - 滚出来
- Why I gotta be-- - Get the fuck out!

1457
01:07:31,770 --> 01:07:32,980
去你们的
Fuck!

1458
01:07:36,350 --> 01:07:39,060
- 马蒂 赶快上车 - 去你们的
- Marty, let's fucking go! - Fuck yourself!

1459
01:07:39,430 --> 01:07:41,350
走 走 走 走 快走
Go, go, go, go, go.

1460
01:07:42,770 --> 01:07:44,480
沃利 注意 注意 电线杆
Wally, watch out! Watch out! The pole!

1461
01:07:45,800 --> 01:07:47,090
不 不
No! No!

1462
01:07:47,100 --> 01:07:48,930
沃利 狗掉了 狗掉下去了 沃利
Wally, the dog. The dog, Wally.

1463
01:07:48,950 --> 01:07:51,080
- 管他的狗 - 不能丢下那狗
- Fuck that dog! - I need the dog!

1464
01:07:51,090 --> 01:07:52,170
去他的狗
Fuck the dog,

1465
01:07:52,190 --> 01:07:54,900
- 天呐 不 不 - 也去你的 去你的
- Oh, no. No! - and fuck you, man! Fuck you, man!

1466
01:07:55,130 --> 01:07:56,670
我这回赔大了
They'll take this out of my paycheck!

1467
01:07:56,690 --> 01:08:00,740
车都废了 得从我工资里扣 我要丢工作了
My car's fucked up, man! I'm gonna lose my fucking job!

1468
01:08:00,910 --> 01:08:03,700
这是我全部生计 我还有家要养呢
This is all I got! I got people depending on me!

1469
01:08:03,710 --> 01:08:06,110
- 我有一大堆担子要扛 - 我也有啊
- I got real responsibilities! - I got responsibilities too.

1470
01:08:06,120 --> 01:08:07,720
- 你有个屁 - 你他妈觉得...
- No, you don't! - What the fuck you think--

1471
01:08:11,260 --> 01:08:14,380
{\an7}♪ ...也许还能融化 ♪
♪ ...may melt again ♪

1472
01:08:14,390 --> 01:08:19,010
{\an7}♪ 像冬雪被四月的雨 ♪
♪ Like winter snow that melts ♪

1473
01:08:19,020 --> 01:08:20,720
{\an7}♪ 一点点 ♪
♪ With ♪

1474
01:08:20,730 --> 01:08:23,420
{\an7}♪ 冲散 ♪
♪ April rain ♪

1475
01:08:23,430 --> 01:08:27,220
{\an7}♪ 亲爱的 亲爱的 ♪
♪ For darling, in my heart ♪

1476
01:08:27,670 --> 01:08:31,800
{\an7}♪ 你永远住在我心里 ♪
♪ You always will remain ♪

1477
01:08:33,180 --> 01:08:38,940
{\an7}♪ 即便夏去秋来 ♪
♪ As summer turns to fall ♪

1478
01:08:41,820 --> 01:08:43,740
太感谢你了 太感谢了
Thank you so much. Thank you.

1479
01:08:43,760 --> 01:08:45,030
我会补偿你的
I'm gonna make it up to you. All right?

1480
01:08:45,050 --> 01:08:46,960
别生我气 行吗?
Don't be mad at me. Okay?

1481
01:08:46,970 --> 01:08:48,790
我会给你买辆新出租 真的
I'm gonna get you a new cab. All right?

1482
01:08:48,810 --> 01:08:50,600
别担心 沃利 我的好兄弟
Don't worry about it. Wally, I love you.

1483
01:08:50,610 --> 01:08:51,860
关门好吗
Close my door.

1484
01:09:18,050 --> 01:09:19,050
嘿 马蒂
Hey, Marty.

1485
01:09:23,350 --> 01:09:24,350
{\an8}（劳伦斯百老汇球场）

1486
01:09:31,300 --> 01:09:34,010
- 嘿 泰德 - 嘿 马蒂 近来怎样？
- Hey, Ted. - Hey, Marty. How you doing, man?

1487
01:09:34,030 --> 01:09:35,550
- 劳伦斯在吗？ - 听说令尊的事情了 请节哀
- Is Lawrence here? - Sorry about your loss.

1488
01:09:35,570 --> 01:09:36,970
没事的 劳伦斯来了吗？
It's all right. Is Lawrence here tonight?

1489
01:09:36,990 --> 01:09:38,750
来了 应该就在里边吧
Uh, yeah. He's around here somewhere.

1490
01:09:38,760 --> 01:09:40,680
- 好的 我去找下 谢了 - 行 行
- Okay. All right. Thank you. - Yeah, yeah.

1491
01:09:40,700 --> 01:09:41,960
- 欢迎回来伙计 - 嗯
- Good to see you, man. - Yep.

1492
01:09:47,380 --> 01:09:48,550
- 马蒂 - 近来可好？
- Hi, Marty. - How you been?

1493
01:09:48,560 --> 01:09:50,430
- 好久不见 - 你好 你好
- Nice to see you. - Hello, Marty.

1494
01:09:50,440 --> 01:09:52,110
今晚能借住你后屋吗 求你了
Hey, can I stay in your back room tonight, please?

1495
01:09:52,130 --> 01:09:55,280
嘿 嘿 你的小妞在后头呢 知道吗？
Hey, hey. Got your girl in the back, okay?

1496
01:09:55,300 --> 01:09:57,020
她怀孕了 现在心情挺糟的
She pregnant. She real upset.

1497
01:09:57,030 --> 01:09:59,020
天呐 好吧 知道了
Oh, God. Okay. All right.

1498
01:09:59,030 --> 01:10:00,520
我去看看她
Uh, let me go talk to her,

1499
01:10:00,530 --> 01:10:02,160
但你千万别走开 我马上回来
but then please don't leave without finding me.

1500
01:10:02,180 --> 01:10:04,120
- 放心 我就在这儿 - 好 很高兴见到你
- Yeah, I'll be here. Okay. - All right. Nice to see you.

1501
01:10:04,140 --> 01:10:05,560
- 也很高兴见到你 - 嗯
- All right, good to see you. - Okay.

1502
01:10:20,650 --> 01:10:21,990
嘿 你来这干嘛啊？
Hey. What are you doing here?

1503
01:10:23,060 --> 01:10:24,710
我不想麻烦你 我知道你很忙
I don't mean to bother you. I know you're really busy.

1504
01:10:24,720 --> 01:10:27,340
- 你这脸怎么回事 谁干的？ - 我真没地方落脚了
- What the hell happened to your face? - I didn't really have anywhere else to go.

1505
01:10:27,350 --> 01:10:28,520
- 让我看看 - 他突然就开始...
- Let me see. - He just started...

1506
01:10:28,540 --> 01:10:30,020
他突然就开始朝我大吼
he just started yelling at me.

1507
01:10:30,040 --> 01:10:32,570
跟疯了一样 还扯我的衣服不撒手
And he was really mad and he was ripping my clothes.

1508
01:10:32,590 --> 01:10:34,910
- 他打的？ - 他把我吓坏了
- He did this to you? - He was really scaring me.

1509
01:10:34,920 --> 01:10:36,670
我真没别处可去了
I just didn't know where else to go.

1510
01:10:37,990 --> 01:10:39,240
你会怪我吗？
Are you mad at me?

1511
01:11:40,340 --> 01:11:41,630
瑞秋？
Rachel?

1512
01:11:41,700 --> 01:11:44,140
不 不是瑞秋 是马蒂 开门
No, it's not Rachel. It's Marty. Open the door.

1513
01:11:44,160 --> 01:11:45,620
等下
Okay. Hang on.

1514
01:11:49,560 --> 01:11:50,750
你怎么来...
What are you doing here?

1515
01:11:52,810 --> 01:11:54,230
活该
Shame on you.

1516
01:12:03,950 --> 01:12:06,730
嘿 迪翁 你好啊 真是打扰了
Hey, Dion. How you doing, man? I really appreciate this.

1517
01:12:06,740 --> 01:12:08,240
这是我妹妹 瑞秋
This is my sister Rachel, by the way.

1518
01:12:08,260 --> 01:12:10,410
瑞秋 这是我朋友 也是我生意伙伴迪翁
Rachel, this is my buddy, my business partner, Dion.

1519
01:12:10,430 --> 01:12:11,660
- 嘿 - 嘿
- Hey. - Hey.

1520
01:12:11,680 --> 01:12:13,000
她家被水淹了
Her place flooded.

1521
01:12:13,020 --> 01:12:15,200
她得借宿一晚 不麻烦吧？
She needs a place to crash for the night. That's okay, right?

1522
01:12:15,210 --> 01:12:16,280
我说不好
I don't know, man, it's...

1523
01:12:16,290 --> 01:12:19,300
我懂 但我不能让她住在都发霉有毒的地方啊
I know, but I can't have her exposed to mold and spores and shit.

1524
01:12:19,320 --> 01:12:22,500
迪翁 帮个忙 她都怀孕八个月了 懂吗？
D, come on, she's eight months pregnant, all right?

1525
01:12:22,510 --> 01:12:23,750
帮个忙
Come on...

1526
01:12:23,760 --> 01:12:25,180
那孩子是我外甥
That's my nephew.

1527
01:12:25,200 --> 01:12:27,190
我家规矩不让带别人回来的
I'm not supposed to have people over.

1528
01:12:27,800 --> 01:12:31,180
她家真没法住了 我不能让她回去 求你了
She's got a bad situation at home. I can't have her going back there. Please.

1529
01:12:31,200 --> 01:12:32,770
好吧 好吧 那就住一晚
All right. Come on. You can spend the night.

1530
01:12:32,790 --> 01:12:35,220
但明天我爸妈回来前就得离开
You just gotta be out of here by tomorrow before my parents get back.

1531
01:12:35,230 --> 01:12:36,300
没问题
Okay. No problem.

1532
01:12:36,310 --> 01:12:38,060
咱们得趁碰这次碰面好好商量下
We should take advantage of the time we have together.

1533
01:12:38,070 --> 01:12:39,560
把生意计划好好商量一下
You know, really firm up our business plan.

1534
01:12:39,570 --> 01:12:41,890
这样你爸一回来 肯定对你另眼相看
That way, when your dad gets back, he sees how organized we are.

1535
01:12:41,900 --> 01:12:43,240
是啊 他挺失望的
Yeah, he's pretty upset.

1536
01:12:43,260 --> 01:12:44,990
这堆货丢这儿 你八个月都没管
You left us with all of this inventory for eight months.

1537
01:12:45,010 --> 01:12:47,020
没关系 几周后我拿下世界冠军
That's fine. In a few weeks I'll take the championship.

1538
01:12:47,030 --> 01:12:48,110
一切都会重回正轨
We'll be right back on track.

1539
01:12:48,120 --> 01:12:49,870
- 球就都在这儿 - 真的？哪儿？
- Balls are right in here. - Really? Where?

1540
01:12:49,890 --> 01:12:51,060
最上头的箱子
The top box.

1541
01:12:51,540 --> 01:12:52,540
谢谢
Thanks.

1542
01:12:58,670 --> 01:13:01,040
- 哇 你做出橙球了？ - 是
- Whoa. You did the orange? - Yep.

1543
01:13:01,050 --> 01:13:02,130
怎么做的？
How'd you do the orange?

1544
01:13:02,150 --> 01:13:03,710
我联系了哈克斯公司
I contacted someone at Halex.

1545
01:13:03,720 --> 01:13:05,260
他们给塑料上的色
They colored the celluloid for me.

1546
01:13:05,280 --> 01:13:06,990
- 怎么办到的？ - 花钱 宝贝
- How? - Money, baby.

1547
01:13:07,760 --> 01:13:09,430
我和我老爸都看好你
Me and my pop, we believe in you.

1548
01:13:09,450 --> 01:13:11,200
我们投了钱的 你消失了 所以他挺生气的
We're invested. That's why he's been so mad.

1549
01:13:13,020 --> 01:13:14,680
瞧瞧这个 瑞秋
Check it out, Rachel.

1550
01:13:14,700 --> 01:13:15,950
来 看看这包装
Here, check out the packaging.

1551
01:13:18,330 --> 01:13:20,460
{\an8}（至尊马蒂牌 马蒂·毛瑟冠军赛官方用球）

1552
01:13:18,760 --> 01:13:21,470
“至尊马蒂牌 马蒂·毛瑟冠军赛官方用球”
"Marty Supreme. The official Marty Mauser championship table tennis ball.

1553
01:13:20,460 --> 01:13:22,670
{\an8}（精心打造 橙球 让你再也不必穿黑衣）

1554
01:13:21,480 --> 01:13:22,860
“精心打造 橙球...”
Professionally made. Orange..."

1555
01:13:22,880 --> 01:13:24,600
这宣传词 你想出来了？
Orange spheres? You came up with that?

1556
01:13:24,610 --> 01:13:25,740
是啊 不错吧
Yeah. Pretty good, right?

1557
01:13:25,760 --> 01:13:28,530
不错吧？迪翁 这让我刮目相看
Pretty good? Dion, this is... I'm stunned.

1558
01:13:29,130 --> 01:13:30,310
刮目相看
I'm stunned.

1559
01:13:30,330 --> 01:13:32,080
- 而且还是手绘的 - 你画的？
- Hand-drawn too. - You drew this?

1560
01:13:32,100 --> 01:13:33,490
- 对 - 真是神来之笔
- Yeah. - It's inspired.

1561
01:13:33,510 --> 01:13:34,370
多谢夸奖
I appreciate it.

1562
01:13:34,380 --> 01:13:36,340
你都不知道自己多有能耐
I don't think you know what you're capable of.

1563
01:13:34,380 --> 01:13:35,940
{\an8}（至尊马蒂 美国制造）

1564
01:13:36,350 --> 01:13:37,870
- 你瞧瞧 - 过奖
- Check it out. - Thanks a lot.

1565
01:13:37,880 --> 01:13:39,130
哇
Wow.

1566
01:13:39,150 --> 01:13:41,020
确实很漂亮
it's really nice.

1567
01:13:42,710 --> 01:13:44,780
- 这是你房间？ - 不是 是我弟弟的
- This is your room? - No, it's my brother's.

1568
01:13:44,790 --> 01:13:46,220
你还有弟弟？你怎么没跟我说过
You have a brother? You never told me you had a brother.

1569
01:13:46,240 --> 01:13:47,650
他已经毕业了 搬出去住了
It's a younger brother. He moved out.

1570
01:13:47,670 --> 01:13:48,960
那这房间空着？
So his room is free?

1571
01:13:49,260 --> 01:13:50,710
- 嗯 对 - 我先去安顿一下我妹
- Uh, yeah. - Let me get my sister situated.

1572
01:13:50,720 --> 01:13:52,180
- 五分钟后去找你 - 行
- I'll come find you in five minutes. - Okay.

1573
01:13:52,200 --> 01:13:53,200
马上见
Five minutes.

1574
01:13:54,430 --> 01:13:55,990
迪翁 你真让我刮目相看
I'm really impressed, D.

1575
01:13:56,010 --> 01:13:57,430
- 过奖 - 真佩服你
- Thank you. - Seriously.

1576
01:13:58,380 --> 01:13:59,670
这家伙真不一般
Special guy.

1577
01:13:59,690 --> 01:14:01,790
我去把床弄好 你就安心躺着吧
Let me get the bed comfortable for you, all right?

1578
01:14:03,030 --> 01:14:04,310
现在就要走了吗？
So are you gonna go out there now?

1579
01:14:04,320 --> 01:14:06,390
对 我得琢磨下明天的计划
Yeah, I gotta figure my plan out for tomorrow.

1580
01:14:06,400 --> 01:14:07,640
什么？什么计划？
Why? Plan for what?

1581
01:14:07,650 --> 01:14:10,200
我得把心态收拾好
Well, I need to get my head together.

1582
01:14:10,650 --> 01:14:12,150
怎么个收拾法儿？
How so?

1583
01:14:12,160 --> 01:14:15,410
有个有钱佬找我干活 我打算联系他
This rich guy hit me up for a job. I think I'm gonna get in touch with him.

1584
01:14:15,940 --> 01:14:18,110
- 真的？ - 是啊
- Really? - Yeah.

1585
01:14:18,130 --> 01:14:20,660
- 什么活？干什么？ - 不重要 能去日本就行
- A job for what? What job? - It doesn't matter. Just to get to Japan.

1586
01:14:21,280 --> 01:14:22,820
- 去打世锦赛吗？ - 对
- For the championship? - Yeah.

1587
01:14:23,330 --> 01:14:24,330
哇
Wow.

1588
01:14:25,150 --> 01:14:28,120
生活一团糟 我会找到出路的
Everything in my life is falling apart, but I'm gonna figure it out.

1589
01:14:28,130 --> 01:14:29,970
要帮忙吗？我可以帮你
Do you need any help? I could help you.

1590
01:14:29,980 --> 01:14:31,790
- 没事 不用了 - 要帮忙吗？
- No, it's all right. It's all right. - Can I do anything?

1591
01:14:31,800 --> 01:14:33,130
你饿吗？
Are you hungry?

1592
01:14:33,140 --> 01:14:34,850
- 不饿 - 确定？
- No. - You sure?

1593
01:14:34,870 --> 01:14:37,210
你休息吧 我就在隔壁
Uh, I'll just be in the other room, all right?

1594
01:14:40,140 --> 01:14:42,880
- 迪翁 这球是绝无仅有的 - 我就说吧 老兄
- Dion, I've never seen anything like this. - I told you, man.

1595
01:14:42,900 --> 01:14:44,360
老兄 咱们得好好叙叙旧
Man, we have to have a big catch-up

1596
01:14:44,380 --> 01:14:47,260
这是八个月来我经历的最好的事
'cause this is the greatest thing that's happened to me in the last eight months.

1597
01:14:47,270 --> 01:14:48,860
找哈克斯 真天才啊
Who would've thought? Halex?

1598
01:15:01,500 --> 01:15:03,330
早上好 罗克韦尔墨业公司
Good morning. Rockwell Ink.

1599
01:15:03,340 --> 01:15:05,800
喂 你好 麻烦帮我接米尔顿·罗克韦尔先生
Yes, hi, can I speak to Milton Rockwell, please?

1600
01:15:05,820 --> 01:15:07,880
他暂时不在 需要留个言吗？
He's not in at the moment. Can I take a message?

1601
01:15:07,900 --> 01:15:09,170
好吧 他什么时候回来？
Okay, when are you expecting him?

1602
01:15:09,190 --> 01:15:11,120
他今天外出
Well, he's working off-site today.

1603
01:15:11,130 --> 01:15:12,970
- 要不要留言？ - 小心烫
- Again, can I take a message? - It's hot.

1604
01:15:12,990 --> 01:15:14,300
太感谢了
Thank you so much.

1605
01:15:14,320 --> 01:15:16,210
等我妹醒了 能给她也弄份吗？
Can you make some for my sister for when she wakes up?

1606
01:15:16,220 --> 01:15:17,800
- 她肯定饿得要命 - 喂？
- She'll be really hungry. - Hello?

1607
01:15:17,810 --> 01:15:19,250
你刚说他外出 具体在哪儿？
You said off-site where?

1608
01:15:19,260 --> 01:15:21,060
抱歉 这个信息我不能透露
I'm sorry, I can't give you that information.

1609
01:15:21,080 --> 01:15:22,980
- 您到底要不要留言？ - 要
- Would you like to leave a message or not? - Yes.

1610
01:15:23,000 --> 01:15:25,470
能替我向他道个歉吗？
Can you apologize to him on my behalf?

1611
01:15:25,480 --> 01:15:27,470
我是原本今早要和他一起吃早饭的
I was the young gentleman that was supposed to have breakfast

1612
01:15:27,480 --> 01:15:28,570
那个年轻人
with him this morning.

1613
01:15:28,590 --> 01:15:30,990
- 我对这事不熟 - 我是他儿子战友
- I'm not familiar. - From his son's battalion.

1614
01:15:28,590 --> 01:15:30,990
{\an8}（《不要鸡飞蛋打》首演）

1615
01:15:31,000 --> 01:15:33,810
抱歉 我 我对此一无所知
I'm sorry, I-- I don't know anything about that.

1616
01:15:33,820 --> 01:15:36,730
我手上有他儿子的遗物 要交给他
I have some personal belongings of his son's I was supposed to give to him.

1617
01:15:36,740 --> 01:15:39,830
信件啊纪念品什么的 但我睡过头来不及了
Letters and mementos and such, but I messed up and I overslept.

1618
01:15:39,850 --> 01:15:42,790
我今天就要走了 要不我回头寄给他？
I'm leaving town today, but I could mail it to him if that's easier.

1619
01:15:42,810 --> 01:15:44,500
- 不 不 不 不行 - 不行？好的
- No, no, no. - No? Okay.

1620
01:15:44,880 --> 01:15:49,050
这样吧 你给莫罗斯科剧院打个电话问问
How about this, why don't you try giving a call over to the Morosco Theatre.

1621
01:15:49,540 --> 01:15:50,910
好 莫罗斯科剧院
The Morosco Theatre.

1622
01:15:50,920 --> 01:15:53,500
所以我算什么？我这是干嘛啊
So, I'm like what? What am I doing?

1623
01:15:53,510 --> 01:15:55,340
真不该来 好好晚上被你毁了
Coming up here to wreck my night.

1624
01:15:55,360 --> 01:15:56,800
说真的 妈 你怎么会在这种地方
Honest, Mama, I didn't even know you were coming here.

1625
01:15:56,820 --> 01:15:58,060
我受够了你这套把戏
I'm through with you playing games.

1626
01:15:58,080 --> 01:15:59,310
我只是来找点乐子
I was just coming for a good time.

1627
01:15:59,330 --> 01:16:01,690
听说应召女郎都在这儿
I heard this was where all the call girls gather.

1628
01:16:03,810 --> 01:16:07,610
我在努力攒钱重建生活 你不明白吗？
I'm trying to rebuild my life here. Don't you understand that?

1629
01:16:07,630 --> 01:16:09,900
你这是出卖自己吧
More like selling out to the highest bidder.

1630
01:16:09,910 --> 01:16:12,400
你没资格评判我 小杰
You've got no right to judge me, Jed.

1631
01:16:12,420 --> 01:16:14,610
我拼尽全力才换来那么一点幸福
I fought tooth and nail for every shred of happiness

1632
01:16:14,630 --> 01:16:16,900
- 我拼尽全力... - 那你给过我什么？
- I've ever found while you... - Right, and what did you give to me?

1633
01:16:16,920 --> 01:16:18,760
你从没相信过我 一次都没有
You never believed in me. Not once!

1634
01:16:20,250 --> 01:16:23,570
少装可怜 你自生自灭吧
You wanna wallow in self-pity? Well, here's an oven, Jed!

1635
01:16:23,580 --> 01:16:24,670
阿尔玛 别
Alma!

1636
01:16:24,690 --> 01:16:25,750
我没事 亨利
I'm all right, Henry.

1637
01:16:25,770 --> 01:16:28,090
- 给我们点时间 - 我妈就是个婊子
- Just give us a minute, please. - My mama is a dirty bird.

1638
01:16:28,110 --> 01:16:30,090
嘴放干净点 杰迪代亚
Be careful now, Jedidiah.

1639
01:16:30,100 --> 01:16:34,720
你给她的那身花衣服 只是掩盖她的耻辱
And that fancy dress you put her in is the only thing keeping in the stench!

1640
01:16:36,640 --> 01:16:38,890
别打我儿子
Don't you lay a hand on my child.

1641
01:16:38,910 --> 01:16:40,620
我...抱歉
I-I'm sorry, uh...

1642
01:16:45,550 --> 01:16:47,770
妈 完蛋了
Mama, what did I do?

1643
01:16:47,790 --> 01:16:49,800
走 快跑
Go! Run!

1644
01:16:56,420 --> 01:16:58,820
- 谁把门锁了 - 真会打断
- The door is locked. - Oh, my God.

1645
01:16:58,840 --> 01:17:00,200
谁锁的啊
You've gotta be kidding me!

1646
01:17:00,220 --> 01:17:02,500
正演戏呢？谁干的 谁给锁的啊
For Christ's sake, did somebody put a latch on the door?

1647
01:17:02,520 --> 01:17:05,000
- 噢天呐 - 我们刚进入节奏
- Oh, God. - I thought we had a good rhythm going.

1648
01:17:05,020 --> 01:17:08,280
进入节奏？演成这样叫节奏？还我们？
A good rhythm going? On what planet is that a good rhythm

1649
01:17:08,290 --> 01:17:09,710
- 你不顾其他人吗？ - 我入戏了
- if you're alone in a room? - I was in it.

1650
01:17:09,730 --> 01:17:12,480
搞得跟我不在场一样 入戏？独角戏？
It's like I wasn't even there. In it? In what?

1651
01:17:12,490 --> 01:17:16,300
- 格伦 我连句台词都插不进去 - 我懂 咱们会解决的
- Glenn, I couldn't get a word out. - I understand. We're gonna fix it.

1652
01:17:16,320 --> 01:17:18,660
- 排练就是为了解决这些 - 真绝了
- That's what a rehearsal process is for. - Fuck's sake.

1653
01:17:18,680 --> 01:17:20,880
先停一下吧 大家休息五分钟
Let's lose this, by the way. Everybody take five.

1654
01:17:20,890 --> 01:17:22,310
帮个忙 各位...
Do me a favor, everybody...

1655
01:17:22,330 --> 01:17:24,600
得有人跟他说说这事
Somebody needs to tell him something.

1656
01:17:24,620 --> 01:17:26,500
- 真离谱 - 真离谱
- It's impossible. - Impossible.

1657
01:17:27,940 --> 01:17:29,730
- 喝水吗？ - 喝
- Do you want some water? - Yes.

1658
01:17:29,750 --> 01:17:31,920
- 我去给你倒 - 天呐
- Let me bring you some. - God.

1659
01:17:35,810 --> 01:17:37,310
嘿 凯
Hey, Kay.

1660
01:17:37,410 --> 01:17:39,080
是我 马蒂
Hey, it's Marty.

1661
01:17:41,750 --> 01:17:43,550
伦敦那个
From London.

1662
01:17:44,500 --> 01:17:45,660
你怎么跑这了？
What are you doing here?

1663
01:17:45,680 --> 01:17:47,320
来见个朋友 他搞舞台的
Well, I got a friend in the stagehands union.

1664
01:17:47,340 --> 01:17:48,630
我过来给他送点东西
I was dropping something off for him.

1665
01:17:48,640 --> 01:17:50,750
- 你刚才看了吧 - 看了 没关系吧
- You watched that? - Yeah, I hope that's okay.

1666
01:17:50,770 --> 01:17:51,880
噢 天呐
Oh, God.

1667
01:17:51,900 --> 01:17:54,210
没想到你又开始演戏了
Hey, I can't believe you're acting again.

1668
01:17:54,230 --> 01:17:56,380
那不叫演戏 他老抢我戏
That wasn't acting. He won't let me act.

1669
01:17:56,400 --> 01:17:59,050
挺气人的 那家伙什么来头？
Yeah, no, that looked frustrating. What's the deal with that guy?

1670
01:17:59,070 --> 01:18:00,340
别提了
Don't get me started.

1671
01:18:00,350 --> 01:18:02,060
即便被抢戏 你也比他演得好
Yeah, you were running circles around him.

1672
01:18:02,890 --> 01:18:04,100
那还用说
Of course I am.

1673
01:18:04,120 --> 01:18:05,730
对 演得真好
Yeah. It was unbelievable.

1674
01:18:05,750 --> 01:18:07,390
他连续三天不睡觉
He stays up for three days in a row

1675
01:18:07,410 --> 01:18:09,730
就是为了要演得累
because his character is supposed to be tired.

1676
01:18:09,750 --> 01:18:11,170
- 真是疯了 - 对啊
- It's obnoxious. - Oh, God.

1677
01:18:13,010 --> 01:18:16,090
他要真投入 怎么会因为那锁打断？
If he's so committed, why'd he stop the scene?

1678
01:18:17,110 --> 01:18:18,990
干嘛不一脚踹开？
Why didn't he punch his hand through the screen,

1679
01:18:19,010 --> 01:18:20,430
接着演呢？
unlock it from the other side?

1680
01:18:21,660 --> 01:18:23,450
- 对吧？换我会这么干 - 格伦
- Right? That's what I would've done. - Glenn!

1681
01:18:23,760 --> 01:18:25,260
- 这就来 - 格伦
- Yeah. - Glenn!

1682
01:18:25,700 --> 01:18:27,700
- 好的 来了 - 我跟你说句话
- Yes. Thank you. Yes. - I need to talk to you.

1683
01:18:30,260 --> 01:18:32,550
- 怎么了？ - 你说怎么了
- Yes, what? - What? What? What?

1684
01:18:32,570 --> 01:18:36,030
这小子比他更懂这个角色
This kid understands the character better than he does.

1685
01:18:36,040 --> 01:18:37,270
你说什么？
Excuse me?

1686
01:18:37,280 --> 01:18:38,630
- 把你刚说的话告诉他 - 不 我不想说
- Tell him what you just told me. - No, I don't want to.

1687
01:18:38,640 --> 01:18:39,430
说吧 告诉他
No, tell him.

1688
01:18:39,450 --> 01:18:41,770
我说你不像是真入戏了
I was just saying you didn't really seem like you were in the scene is all.

1689
01:18:42,630 --> 01:18:45,320
- 他是谁？ - 当局者迷
- Uh, who is this? - He's nobody.

1690
01:18:45,340 --> 01:18:48,770
- 旁观者清 - 而且 在我看来
- That's the point. - Also, you know, in my experience,

1691
01:18:50,020 --> 01:18:51,880
只有玩过家家才这样拿刀
only children hold a knife like this.

1692
01:18:51,890 --> 01:18:53,560
要是真打 刀该这样拿
If it's a serious fight, you hold your knife like this,

1693
01:18:53,580 --> 01:18:54,950
- 刀要在上面 - 这又不是街头斗殴
- with the blade square to your wrist. - This is not a street fight.

1694
01:18:54,970 --> 01:18:56,400
好吧 既然你们不求真的话
Okay, well, if you're not going for realistic,

1695
01:18:56,410 --> 01:18:58,150
还得再加点花样
you might as well add a little flair.

1696
01:19:01,970 --> 01:19:03,130
就像这样
Like that.

1697
01:19:03,140 --> 01:19:04,480
- 别闹了 - 对吧 凯？
- Cut it out. - Right, Kay?

1698
01:19:04,500 --> 01:19:06,750
行了 行了 谢了你的教程 谢谢
Yeah, okay. Thanks for the tutorial. Thank you very much.

1699
01:19:06,760 --> 01:19:10,860
真是太感谢了 抓紧走吧 谢谢
Thank you very much indeed. That's all we need today. Thank you.

1700
01:19:10,870 --> 01:19:12,630
- 加油 凯 - 送他出去
- Best of luck, Kay. Best of luck. - Get him out!

1701
01:19:12,650 --> 01:19:15,670
这里不需要你了 谢谢 抓紧走吧
We no longer require your presence. Thank you very much.

1702
01:19:15,690 --> 01:19:18,050
恕我直言...
Well, with all due respect...

1703
01:19:18,070 --> 01:19:19,880
每套布景竟然都要5000多块
And yet every set cost more than $5,000.

1704
01:19:19,900 --> 01:19:23,380
要让您太太高兴又少花钱 真办不到啊
I can't just snap my fingers and get your money and your wife into alignment.

1705
01:19:23,390 --> 01:19:24,890
那我花钱雇你干嘛
I pay you to say no.

1706
01:19:24,900 --> 01:19:26,810
让她感觉有主导权 又要控制她开销
She seems to think that this is carte blanche.

1707
01:19:26,830 --> 01:19:28,530
这根本做不到啊
I can't just perform the impossible here.

1708
01:19:28,550 --> 01:19:31,930
要是你做不到 我就另请他人
If you can't control her, I will find someone else who can.

1709
01:19:32,240 --> 01:19:33,450
混蛋
Asshole.

1710
01:19:38,490 --> 01:19:41,100
罗克韦尔先生 请等一下
Mr. Rockwell. Mr. Rockwell.

1711
01:19:41,110 --> 01:19:43,710
- 干什么？ - 是我 马蒂·毛瑟 又见面了
- What? - Hey. Marty Mauser. Nice to see you.

1712
01:19:43,740 --> 01:19:47,460
是不是你冒充我儿子战友给我办公室打的电话？
Did you call my office and say you're friends with my son?

1713
01:19:47,620 --> 01:19:48,990
- 是的 但是... - 混蛋
- Yes. But... - Goddamn it!

1714
01:19:49,000 --> 01:19:51,070
我没别的办法联络您了 请您听我说
I had no other way to get in touch with you. Please.

1715
01:19:51,080 --> 01:19:52,710
我想再谈谈去日本的事
I wanna revisit our conversation about Japan.

1716
01:19:52,730 --> 01:19:54,950
我重新考虑过了 我想去 我觉得主意不错
I reconsidered it and I wanna do it. I think it's a great idea.

1717
01:19:54,960 --> 01:19:56,870
比赛就在下周 我已经有别的计划了
The event's next week. I've made alternate plans.

1718
01:19:56,880 --> 01:19:58,580
别的计划？这最初可是您的主意
What other plans? Okay, it was your idea.

1719
01:19:58,590 --> 01:20:01,620
这主意棒极了 求您给我两分钟谈谈
It's a fantastic idea. Let's just have a conversation about this for two seconds.

1720
01:20:01,630 --> 01:20:04,220
你干什么呢？嘿 嘿 罗克韦尔先生
What are you doing? Hey. Hey. Mr. Rockwell.

1721
01:20:04,240 --> 01:20:06,140
求您了 咱们务实些
Please, let's both be pragmatists about this.

1722
01:20:06,160 --> 01:20:08,310
把私人感情放一边
Put your personal feelings about me aside for a second.

1723
01:20:08,330 --> 01:20:11,390
您也知道 我和远藤合作能带来多少好处
You and I both know how much value I would add with Endo.

1724
01:20:11,410 --> 01:20:13,270
在他的主场打表演赛？
In an exhibition on his home turf?

1725
01:20:13,290 --> 01:20:15,190
势必会引爆全场
Imagine it. I'd be like a stick of dynamite.

1726
01:20:15,210 --> 01:20:16,770
不管您的备选计划是什么
Whatever you have planned, the alternative,

1727
01:20:16,790 --> 01:20:18,140
都比不上这个
it's gonna pale in comparison.

1728
01:20:18,150 --> 01:20:19,360
请给我两分钟
Please give me two minutes.

1729
01:20:19,380 --> 01:20:22,520
我们还能达成共识 求您了
We have enough common ground to figure this out. Please!

1730
01:20:22,530 --> 01:20:25,070
- 行吧 上车说 - 真的？谢谢
- All right, get in the car. - Really? Thank you.

1731
01:20:25,090 --> 01:20:26,300
汤米 开车
Tommy, let's go.

1732
01:20:27,430 --> 01:20:29,990
嘿 嘿 嘿 嘿
Hey. Hey! Hey! Hey!

1733
01:20:30,440 --> 01:20:32,830
你这王八蛋 桌球还是我给你引荐的
You son of a bitch. I gave you the idea!

1734
01:20:43,220 --> 01:20:45,920
不好意思 凯·斯通女士让我转告你
I'm sorry. Ms. Stone wanted to let you know

1735
01:20:45,930 --> 01:20:47,760
她想与您共进午餐
that she'd love to have lunch with you.

1736
01:20:47,780 --> 01:20:49,370
- 凯·斯通？ - 是的
- Ms. Stone? - Yes.

1737
01:21:06,100 --> 01:21:07,610
天呐 我迟到太久了
My God, I'm so late.

1738
01:21:07,620 --> 01:21:09,200
在意这些干嘛
Come on. What do you care?

1739
01:21:09,220 --> 01:21:11,740
你可是主角 心里应该爽才对
You're the star. Gotta feel pretty good, right?

1740
01:21:11,750 --> 01:21:13,610
话说 你当初为啥退出演艺圈？
I mean, why'd you even stop in the first place?

1741
01:21:13,620 --> 01:21:16,210
我想要个保障 结果怀孕了
I wanted security, and I got pregnant,

1742
01:21:17,130 --> 01:21:19,920
他又给我压力 我就答应了
and he pressured me, and I settled.

1743
01:21:19,940 --> 01:21:22,340
眼下你是走对路了
Well, I mean, clearly, you're doing the right thing now

1744
01:21:22,360 --> 01:21:24,510
而且他看起来正加倍补偿你
and it sounds like he's paying you back with interest.

1745
01:21:24,530 --> 01:21:26,680
- 谁补偿？ - 你丈夫
- Who is? - Your husband.

1746
01:21:26,700 --> 01:21:28,260
你的演出都是他出钱吧？
I mean, he's funding your whole show, right?

1747
01:21:28,280 --> 01:21:29,350
哪来的这种想法？
Where'd you get that idea?

1748
01:21:29,370 --> 01:21:31,180
我在走廊无意听到他嘟囔这些
I overheard him complaining about it in the lobby.

1749
01:21:31,200 --> 01:21:33,040
- 嘟囔？ - 是的 抱怨开销太大
- Complaining? - Yeah, about the costs.

1750
01:21:34,330 --> 01:21:35,550
让他滚一边去吧
He can go fuck himself.

1751
01:21:35,560 --> 01:21:37,190
没错 彻底滚蛋
Completely. You know what you should do,

1752
01:21:37,210 --> 01:21:39,100
你应该把他榨干
you should leech him for every penny he's worth,

1753
01:21:39,110 --> 01:21:40,900
把自己捧成最红的星
assume your place as the biggest star on the planet,

1754
01:21:40,920 --> 01:21:42,780
然后狠狠打他那张自大嘴脸
and then you rub it in his smug little face.

1755
01:21:42,800 --> 01:21:45,900
谢谢 我可不想听你的人生建议
Thank you, but I'm really not looking for life advice from you.

1756
01:21:45,920 --> 01:21:48,910
不 我只是说 你根本不用靠他
No, I'm just saying you clearly never needed him in the first place.

1757
01:21:50,450 --> 01:21:52,620
就像我 绝不靠谁帮忙
Like with me, I'm never accepting anyone's help.

1758
01:21:52,640 --> 01:21:56,750
我只靠我自己 靠我的才能
I gotta do it completely on my own. Purely on the basis of my own talent.

1759
01:21:56,770 --> 01:21:59,920
不然的话 奖杯都被玷污了
Otherwise it's, like, the success won't even count.

1760
01:21:59,940 --> 01:22:01,120
这只是我自己的观念
But that's just me.

1761
01:22:01,130 --> 01:22:03,420
说起来倒是容易
Yes, well, that's very easy to say.

1762
01:22:03,440 --> 01:22:06,300
说起来容易 做起来可真难
Well, it's easy to say but it's sure not easy to do.

1763
01:22:06,320 --> 01:22:08,610
你懂的 所以你才拿钱退圈了
I mean, you know that. That's why you cashed out.

1764
01:22:11,050 --> 01:22:12,390
我问你个事
Let me ask you something.

1765
01:22:13,060 --> 01:22:15,640
你靠这门小乒乓挣到钱了吗？
Do you make money at this little table tennis thing?

1766
01:22:15,660 --> 01:22:17,910
- 还没呢 - 你有工作吗？
- Not yet. - Do you have a job?

1767
01:22:18,350 --> 01:22:20,510
没有 我是说 桌球就是我的工作
No. I mean, table tennis is my job.

1768
01:22:20,520 --> 01:22:21,610
那你靠什么糊口？
How do you live?

1769
01:22:21,630 --> 01:22:22,680
我靠信念
I live with the confidence

1770
01:22:22,690 --> 01:22:24,480
只要我相信自己 钱自然会来的
that if I believe in myself, the money will follow.

1771
01:22:24,500 --> 01:22:27,030
归根结底 我奋斗的重点不是钱
Ultimately, my struggle isn't even about money.

1772
01:22:27,050 --> 01:22:29,200
- 你怎么交房租？ - 不交
- How do you pay rent? - I don't.

1773
01:22:29,220 --> 01:22:31,370
- 你是在回避问题 - 不 我没回避
- You're avoiding the question. - No, I'm not avoiding anything.

1774
01:22:31,390 --> 01:22:33,300
那今天你打算怎么吃饭？
How do you plan on eating food today?

1775
01:22:33,320 --> 01:22:36,450
说实话 我打算你一走就叫客房送饭来
Honestly, I was gonna order room service the second you leave.

1776
01:22:36,460 --> 01:22:39,070
- 真行啊 - 是啊 是啊
- Nice. - Yeah. Nice.

1777
01:22:39,080 --> 01:22:41,760
要是你这梦想行不通 你有什么打算？
And what do you plan to do if this whole dream of yours doesn't work out?

1778
01:22:41,780 --> 01:22:43,950
我压根不会想这种事情
That doesn't even enter my consciousness.

1779
01:22:44,330 --> 01:22:46,300
好吧 也许你得考虑一下现实了
Okay. Well, maybe it should.

1780
01:22:47,390 --> 01:22:48,390
哇
Wow.

1781
01:22:48,760 --> 01:22:51,550
别介意 但你这口气真像我妈
You sound like my mom. No offense.

1782
01:22:51,570 --> 01:22:53,390
你倒像个小屁孩
And you sound like a child.

1783
01:22:53,410 --> 01:22:55,630
是吗？我可够成熟的
Oh, yeah? Clearly I'm old enough.

1784
01:22:55,640 --> 01:22:56,930
你什么意思？
And what is that supposed to mean?

1785
01:22:56,940 --> 01:22:58,680
成熟到能在你东山再起的时候
That I'm old enough to fuck you in your hotel room

1786
01:22:58,690 --> 01:23:00,610
在酒店干你一场 还是你开的房
in the middle of your big comeback.

1787
01:23:00,620 --> 01:23:01,770
你真下流
You're disgusting.

1788
01:23:04,140 --> 01:23:05,140
祝演出顺利
Break a leg.

1789
01:23:12,820 --> 01:23:14,620
我明白 不过我在外地
No, I know, but I was out of town

1790
01:23:14,640 --> 01:23:16,970
这信我昨天才刚收着
so I only just received it yesterday for the first time.

1791
01:23:17,500 --> 01:23:20,330
去日本行程已经订好了 改不了了
Well, look, not coming to Japan is not an option.

1792
01:23:20,960 --> 01:23:24,170
麻烦跟拉姆·塞西说 全额的
Okay, well, just let Mr. Sethi know that a cashier's check in the full amount

1793
01:23:24,190 --> 01:23:26,160
银行担保的赔付支票已经寄出
is already on the way to him. It's in the mail.

1794
01:23:26,630 --> 01:23:27,690
不介意 只是...
No, that's fine, but just...

1795
01:23:27,710 --> 01:23:29,750
别在现场一见到我就惊讶
I don't want any confusion about my attendance.

1796
01:23:29,760 --> 01:23:31,800
我一定到场 开赛时肯定见得着我
I'm gonna be there. I'm gonna be there when the tournament starts.

1797
01:23:31,820 --> 01:23:35,180
- 找到了 - 太好了 太好了 太好了
- I got it! - Yes! Yes! Yes!

1798
01:23:36,140 --> 01:23:37,140
能值多少钱？
How much do you think?

1799
01:23:38,690 --> 01:23:40,300
- 这是假货 - 假货？你什么意思？
- This is not real. - What do you mean it's not real?

1800
01:23:40,310 --> 01:23:42,510
- 完全赝品 - 这可是从大富婆脖子上摘下来的
- Total fake. - It came from the neck of a millionaire.

1801
01:23:42,520 --> 01:23:43,930
我亲眼看着摘下来的
I saw it come off her neck.

1802
01:23:43,940 --> 01:23:47,950
我不管来路 这玩意不值钱
I don't care where it came from. It's total garbage.

1803
01:23:47,970 --> 01:23:49,580
- 装饰用的仿制品 - 装饰用的？
- Costume jewelry. - Costume jewelry?

1804
01:23:49,590 --> 01:23:51,350
- 嗯 - 该死
- Yeah. - Oh, fuck.

1805
01:23:51,360 --> 01:23:53,440
想卖的话 我最多给你两块钱
If you want, I can give you two bucks for it.

1806
01:23:54,070 --> 01:23:56,280
- 喂 - 喂 迪翁 是我
- Hello. - Hey, Dion. It's me.

1807
01:23:56,300 --> 01:23:57,410
忙不忙啊
How are you doing?

1808
01:23:57,430 --> 01:24:00,330
你跑哪去了？你答应过要准备经销商名单的
Hey, where have you been? You promised me we'd have a list of distributors.

1809
01:24:00,350 --> 01:24:01,460
我爸今晚就回来了
My dad lands tonight.

1810
01:24:01,480 --> 01:24:03,210
我这就回去 全力做这件事
I'll come back now and give you my undivided attention.

1811
01:24:03,230 --> 01:24:04,830
先让我跟我妹说句话
Let me just talk to my sister for a second.

1812
01:24:04,840 --> 01:24:07,130
瑞秋 马蒂来电话了
Rachel, Marty's on the phone.

1813
01:24:08,670 --> 01:24:10,420
- 喂 你在哪儿？ - 喂 瑞秋 听好了
- Hi. Where are you? - Hi, Rachel, listen.

1814
01:24:10,440 --> 01:24:12,750
我夹克里有个狗项圈
There's a dog collar in my jacket, okay?

1815
01:24:12,760 --> 01:24:14,680
有个人狗在新泽西丢了
I know a guy who lost a dog out in New Jersey.

1816
01:24:14,700 --> 01:24:16,250
他会付大笔赏金
He'll pay a big reward.

1817
01:24:16,260 --> 01:24:19,010
还有 他家车钥匙在门口小碗里
Also, there's a set of car keys in a bowl by the front door.

1818
01:24:19,020 --> 01:24:20,230
- 看见了吗？ - 看见了
- You see them? - Yeah.

1819
01:24:19,020 --> 01:24:27,775
{\an8}（加油站）

1820
01:24:20,240 --> 01:24:22,980
把车偷偷开来 别让迪翁瞧见
Grab the keys, and make sure Dion doesn't see you do it.

1821
01:24:23,000 --> 01:24:24,060
嘿 迪翁
Hey, Dion.

1822
01:24:24,080 --> 01:24:26,060
能去商店帮我买点生姜吗？
Can you go to the store and grab me some ginger?

1823
01:24:26,080 --> 01:24:28,400
我晨吐反应特别厉害
I'm having really bad morning sickness.

1824
01:24:29,500 --> 01:24:30,590
嗨
Hi.

1825
01:24:31,450 --> 01:24:32,980
抱歉 加油站打样了
Sorry, station's closed.

1826
01:24:32,990 --> 01:24:35,240
没事 我们不是来加油的
That's okay. We're not looking for service.

1827
01:24:35,260 --> 01:24:38,150
你们附近有看到跑丢的狗吗？
Did you see a dog come around here?

1828
01:24:38,160 --> 01:24:40,240
没 没见着 你瞧见狗了吗？
Nah, I ain't seen nothing. You seen a dog?

1829
01:24:40,250 --> 01:24:42,120
- 差不多这么高 - 什么时候丢的？
- He's this tall. - When did you lose it?

1830
01:24:42,140 --> 01:24:43,390
几天前
A few days ago.

1831
01:24:43,410 --> 01:24:46,950
克兰伯里有个收容所 往那走大概八公里
There's a pound down in Cranberry. About five miles that way.

1832
01:24:46,960 --> 01:24:48,500
- 问问他们 - 我打过电话了
- Maybe try there. - I called there.

1833
01:24:49,170 --> 01:24:50,750
- 抱歉 帮不上忙 - 好吧
- Sorry, can't help you. - Okay.

1834
01:24:50,970 --> 01:24:52,970
谢谢
Thank you.

1835
01:25:03,500 --> 01:25:04,960
没人看到狗
They didn't see anything.

1836
01:25:08,070 --> 01:25:09,490
咱们去那里试试
Let's go try that place.

1837
01:25:46,980 --> 01:25:48,160
有人在家吗？
Hello.

1838
01:25:50,820 --> 01:25:52,320
有人吗?
Hello?

1839
01:25:57,100 --> 01:25:59,520
- 你去哪？ - 我去后面瞧瞧
- Where are you going? - Just gonna check out back.

1840
01:26:08,040 --> 01:26:11,000
我去 摩西
Oh, shit. Moses.

1841
01:26:11,020 --> 01:26:13,440
“我们非常感谢全国各地的唱片商和艺术家们”
"We're grateful to the record manufacturers and artists

1842
01:26:13,690 --> 01:26:14,860
“全国各地的艺术家们”
all over the country."

1843
01:26:22,930 --> 01:26:24,850
嘿 狗狗 嘿 嘿 摩西
Hey, buddy. Hey. Hey, Moses.

1844
01:26:24,860 --> 01:26:26,250
是我 马蒂 乖狗狗
It's Marty. Hey, buddy.

1845
01:26:26,270 --> 01:26:27,270
该死
Oh, fuck.

1846
01:26:29,190 --> 01:26:30,270
乖狗狗
Hey, buddy.

1847
01:26:31,070 --> 01:26:31,980
摩西 摩西
Moses. Moses!

1848
01:26:32,000 --> 01:26:34,360
冷静 冷静 我来带你回家
Hey, buddy. Calm down. Let's get you home.

1849
01:26:34,380 --> 01:26:36,240
想不想回家？走 咱们回家
You wanna go home, right? Let's go home.

1850
01:26:36,240 --> 01:26:38,310
好了 别 别 别
Okay. Hey. No, no, no, no, no.

1851
01:26:38,320 --> 01:26:41,200
“刚才为您播放的是佩珀敏特·哈里斯”
"And that was Peppermint Harris

1852
01:26:41,220 --> 01:26:43,930
“以及他的那首金曲...”
"and that great record of his...

1853
01:26:46,580 --> 01:26:49,170
“不过现在是时候暂别这档节目了”
"But it's time to hang up the old blunderbuss for now.

1854
01:26:49,190 --> 01:26:51,190
“记住 如果你想...”
"Remember, if you want any..."

1855
01:26:58,000 --> 01:27:00,320
- 你好？ - 有事吗？
- Hi, how are you? - Can I help you?

1856
01:27:00,330 --> 01:27:03,150
我们狗丢了 正在找狗
We were just searching the area for a lost dog.

1857
01:27:03,160 --> 01:27:05,680
- 你们？ - 我和我丈夫
- "We"? - My husband and I.

1858
01:27:05,700 --> 01:27:08,540
我们的狗几天前在加油站附近丢了
We lost our dog a couple of days ago out near the gas station

1859
01:27:09,060 --> 01:27:11,550
他们叫我们来这边瞧瞧...
and they told us to come and check over here...

1860
01:27:11,560 --> 01:27:13,070
- 因为你是最近的一户人家 - 谁？
- seeing that you're the closest house. - Who?

1861
01:27:13,080 --> 01:27:14,310
谁让你来的？哪个加油站？
Who? Which gas station?

1862
01:27:14,320 --> 01:27:15,480
- 我说不上来 - 嘿
- I don't know. - Hey!

1863
01:27:15,500 --> 01:27:16,640
是加油站伙计说的
It was one of the guys that work there.

1864
01:27:16,650 --> 01:27:18,530
- 老兄 你终于来了 - 我丈夫
- Oh, man, I'm so excited you're back. - There he is!

1865
01:27:18,550 --> 01:27:20,320
- 看来你捡到了我们的狗 - 你们在私闯民宅
- I think you might've found our dog. - You're trespassing.

1866
01:27:20,340 --> 01:27:23,150
别误会 抱歉打扰了 我们听到后院有狗叫
No. I'm sorry, that's not our intention. We heard barking in the back.

1867
01:27:23,160 --> 01:27:24,830
我不懂你在说啥
I have no idea what you're talking about.

1868
01:27:24,850 --> 01:27:26,730
我的狗 被你捡到了
My dog. You found it.

1869
01:27:26,740 --> 01:27:28,250
我没捡过狗
I didn't find any dog.

1870
01:27:29,030 --> 01:27:30,410
你确定？
Are you sure?

1871
01:27:30,430 --> 01:27:32,040
我当然确定 你呢？
Yeah, I'm sure. Are you sure?

1872
01:27:32,060 --> 01:27:33,190
是啊...
Yeah...

1873
01:27:35,550 --> 01:27:36,630
我趴着你那窗户
I looked through your window.

1874
01:27:36,650 --> 01:27:38,260
- 看到了我的狗 - 你竟然偷看我窗户？
- I saw my dog. - You were looking through my window?

1875
01:27:38,280 --> 01:27:39,440
是啊 不看怎么找到的
Yeah, It was a good thing I did, right?

1876
01:27:39,450 --> 01:27:42,070
趁我报警前 赶紧滚出我的地盘
Get the hell off my property before I call the police.

1877
01:27:42,090 --> 01:27:43,750
该叫警察的是我才对
You call? I should call the police.

1878
01:27:43,760 --> 01:27:46,000
行啊 要不要再核实下看清楚？
Okay. You wanna get a closer look at him?

1879
01:27:46,010 --> 01:27:47,330
- 近距离看清楚？ - 是的 麻烦了
- You wanna closer look? - Yes, please.

1880
01:27:47,350 --> 01:27:49,770
行 我就让你看清楚
Okay, good, good. I'll give you a closer look.

1881
01:27:58,190 --> 01:27:59,480
嘿
Hey!

1882
01:28:00,060 --> 01:28:01,060
冷静点
Calm down.

1883
01:28:01,490 --> 01:28:02,570
我很冷静
I am calm.

1884
01:28:03,620 --> 01:28:06,440
- 你这张犹太脸... - 你认真的？
- If I see your kike face... - Are you serious?

1885
01:28:06,460 --> 01:28:08,600
- ...再敢偷瞄我窗户 - 马蒂 快上车
- ...looking through my window again... - Marty, get in the car!

1886
01:28:08,620 --> 01:28:10,550
- 你疯了吗？ - ...我我就把你脸打烂
- Are you out of your mind? - ...I'm gonna shoot it off.

1887
01:28:10,570 --> 01:28:13,150
别把事搞大 我们这就走 马蒂 快上车
There's no need for that. We're leaving. Marty, get in!

1888
01:28:13,330 --> 01:28:14,710
你疯了吗？
What are you doing?

1889
01:28:14,770 --> 01:28:17,100
- 马蒂 快上车 - 不行 必须得拿到狗
- Get in the car, Marty! - No! I need the dog!

1890
01:28:17,120 --> 01:28:20,310
- 快上车 - 看我不打爆你的脸
- Get in the car! - Next one's going to your face.

1891
01:28:20,320 --> 01:28:22,530
马蒂 快...
Marty, get...

1892
01:28:22,550 --> 01:28:24,130
哦 不 不 不 别开枪 别开枪
No, no, no, no! Don't shoot! Don't shoot!

1893
01:28:24,150 --> 01:28:26,390
瑞秋 快帮我
Rachel! Help me!

1894
01:28:32,160 --> 01:28:34,200
马蒂 快上车
Marty, get in the car!

1895
01:28:34,210 --> 01:28:38,290
快点 快点 快跑 快跑
Come on, come on, come on. Hurry! Hurry!

1896
01:28:38,870 --> 01:28:40,240
上车 上车 上车
Get in! Get in! Get in!

1897
01:28:40,250 --> 01:28:42,300
开车 开车 开车 快开 瑞秋 快
Go, go, go straight, Rachel. Go, go!

1898
01:28:43,220 --> 01:28:45,300
超前开 快 开进玉米地
Straight! Go! Go in the corn!

1899
01:28:46,130 --> 01:28:48,770
- 快开 快开 快开 - 天呐 天呐 天呐
- Go, go, go, go, go, go, go. - Oh, my god! Oh, my god! Oh, my god!

1900
01:28:51,060 --> 01:28:52,270
天呐
Oh, no!

1901
01:28:54,310 --> 01:28:56,660
{\an8}（摩西）

1902
01:29:09,280 --> 01:29:10,700
- 喂 - 喂
- Hello? - Hi.

1903
01:29:10,890 --> 01:29:11,980
你是不是...
Hi, did you...

1904
01:29:11,990 --> 01:29:14,780
你是不是丢了一只叫摩西的狗？
Did you by any chance lose a dog named Moses?

1905
01:29:15,830 --> 01:29:17,290
丢了 怎么了？
Yeah, I did. Why?

1906
01:29:17,310 --> 01:29:19,830
真的？太好了 我们刚好捡到他
Oh, you did? Amazing! 'Cause we just found him.

1907
01:29:19,840 --> 01:29:21,630
- 真的假的？ - 真的
- For real? - I did, yeah.

1908
01:29:21,640 --> 01:29:24,200
- 他怎么样 还喘不喘？ - 实话跟你说
- How is he? How's his breathing? - You know what?

1909
01:29:24,210 --> 01:29:27,520
刚开始他呼吸挺虚的
When we got him, his breathing was a little shallow.

1910
01:29:27,540 --> 01:29:29,540
- 赶紧谈钱 - 把你地址给我
- The money. - Give me your address.

1911
01:29:29,550 --> 01:29:31,050
我马上到
I'm gonna come right now.

1912
01:29:31,070 --> 01:29:33,040
事情没那么简单
Well, that's the thing.

1913
01:29:33,930 --> 01:29:36,060
你什么意思？
The thing? What do you mean?

1914
01:29:36,080 --> 01:29:38,560
这事儿按惯例
'Cause you know in situations like these it's...

1915
01:29:38,580 --> 01:29:41,770
应该给点赏钱吧？
it's kind of customary to give the person a reward, no?

1916
01:29:41,790 --> 01:29:44,130
好吧 那你想要多少？
Yeah, fine. How much you have in mind?

1917
01:29:45,190 --> 01:29:47,640
- 开价太高了吧？ - 不高 他有的是钱
- It's too much money. It's too much. - No, say it. He's fucking loaded.

1918
01:29:47,660 --> 01:29:48,770
- 喂 - 快说
- Hello? - Tell him.

1919
01:29:49,640 --> 01:29:52,840
要我说2000挺合适的
I was thinking maybe $2,000 seems fair for this kind of a thing.

1920
01:29:52,850 --> 01:29:54,350
挺公道的
That seems pretty fair to me.

1921
01:29:54,370 --> 01:29:56,120
- 只要2000 - 你开玩笑吧？
- Two thousand. - You're joking, right?

1922
01:29:56,730 --> 01:29:59,360
- 没开玩笑 - 你他妈在耍我吧
- No, no. No. - That's fucking ridiculous.

1923
01:29:59,380 --> 01:30:00,380
听着 听着...
Look, look...

1924
01:30:01,690 --> 01:30:03,820
我知道这跟你没关系 但...
I know it's really not your problem, but...

1925
01:30:04,650 --> 01:30:08,440
但我快生了 而且我一个人 没丈夫
I'm about to have a baby, and, look, I got no husband right now.

1926
01:30:08,450 --> 01:30:11,490
也没工作 这钱就算行善积德了
I got no job, and this money would really, really help me.

1927
01:30:11,510 --> 01:30:13,450
咱们行善吧
And, you know, let's be good people and...

1928
01:30:13,470 --> 01:30:16,710
那狗是我在收容所白领的 知道吗？
You realize I got that dog for free at the pound, right?

1929
01:30:17,460 --> 01:30:20,200
这么想就错了
Well, that's kind of the wrong way to look at it.

1930
01:30:20,210 --> 01:30:22,460
- 错了？ - 对 错了
- Oh, really? - Yeah, really.

1931
01:30:22,480 --> 01:30:23,980
那我该怎么想？
How am I supposed to look at it?

1932
01:30:24,000 --> 01:30:26,760
比方说我不是在谈狗
'Cause let's just say that I'm not calling about a dog.

1933
01:30:26,780 --> 01:30:28,750
比方说我是在说你母亲
Let's say that I'm calling about your mother,

1934
01:30:28,770 --> 01:30:31,430
我是医生 要做急救手术
and I'm a doctor, and I gotta perform emergency surgery on her

1935
01:30:31,450 --> 01:30:33,090
不然她会死 你该怎么办？
or she's gonna die. What are you gonna do?

1936
01:30:33,100 --> 01:30:35,640
你能因她不是买来的就不救吗？
Refuse the surgery because you got your mother for free?

1937
01:30:35,660 --> 01:30:37,480
不会的 你会救你母亲
No! That's crazy. You're gonna take the surgery

1938
01:30:37,500 --> 01:30:39,480
- 因为你爱她 - 这是什么胡扯比喻
- because you love your mother. - That's the stupidest thing I ever heard.

1939
01:30:39,500 --> 01:30:42,020
那就说明你不懂爱
Well, then I guess you don't know anything about love.

1940
01:30:42,040 --> 01:30:45,890
行了 别扯了 把地址给我 我现在就来
All right, forget it. Give me your address, okay? I'll come now.

1941
01:30:45,900 --> 01:30:48,220
- 带钱来 - 抱歉 但不行
- I'll bring you the cash. - I'm sorry, but no.

1942
01:30:48,230 --> 01:30:49,750
- 不行？ - 不行
- No? - No.

1943
01:30:49,770 --> 01:30:52,860
别误会 你听着也像好人
it's really not your fault, and you sound like a very nice person.

1944
01:30:52,870 --> 01:30:55,400
但我以前被坑过太多次了
It's just I've been ripped off one too many times in the past,

1945
