1989
01:32:41,840 --> 01:32:44,060
- 我们没别的地方可去了 - 你们必须得走
- We got no other place to stay. - You guys gotta go.

1990
01:32:44,080 --> 01:32:45,480
不 迪翁 我们必须得留下
No. Dion. We have to stay.

1991
01:32:45,500 --> 01:32:47,400
- 没别的地方... 迪翁 别这样 - 不行 嘘
- We have nowhere-- Dion. Stop it. - No. Shh.

1992
01:32:47,420 --> 01:32:49,290
她都怀孕八个月了 你疯了吗？
She's eight months pregnant. Are you out of your mind?

1993
