- 让她小声点 - 我尽量 我尽量 我先把她安抚好
- Keep her voice down. - I'm gonna try, but I gotta calm her down.

2020
01:33:44,560 --> 01:33:45,790
抱歉
Sorry.

2021
01:33:47,290 --> 01:33:49,800
这怎么办啊 这怎么办啊
I don't know what to do. I don't know what to do.

2022
01:33:51,550 --> 01:33:52,960
演得真好
That was really good.

2023
01:33:52,980 --> 01:33:54,590
- 瑞秋 演得太好了 - 谢谢
- That was amazing, Rachel. - Thank you.

2024
01:33:54,610 --> 01:33:55,800
太好了 这招也许行得通
That was so good, it might work.

2025
01:33:55,820 --> 01:33:58,010
- 要是被赶了 下一步去哪？ - 他估计不会赶咱们了
- Where are we gonna go if he kicks us out? - He might actually let us stay now.

2026
01:33:58,030 --> 01:33:59,800
多亏你这套苦肉计
That acting was so brilliant.

2027
01:33:59,810 --> 01:34:02,560
- 你还真哭出来了？ - 不要 马蒂 你干嘛
- Are you actually crying? - No. Marty, what are you doing?

2028
