嘿 明早咱们得和斯伯丁开个会
Hey, we have a meeting with Spalding first thing in the morning

2055
01:35:03,390 --> 01:35:07,580
{\an8}【斯伯丁:知名美国运动器材公司】

2056
01:35:05,660 --> 01:35:07,620
- 谈至尊球的事 - 迪翁 醒醒吧
- for the Supreme samples. - Dion, come on. Give me a break.

2057
01:35:07,640 --> 01:35:09,240
别做白日梦了
That's never gonna happen.

2058
