This one is for my son.

2394
01:55:48,110 --> 01:55:49,570
好
Okay.

2395
01:55:49,580 --> 01:55:51,290
这一下是给我解气的
This one is for me.

2396
01:55:52,660 --> 01:55:54,200
哎呦
God!

2397
01:55:54,230 --> 01:55:55,850
下面是加赛环节
Now the bonus round.

2398
01:55:58,630 --> 01:56:03,170
多好的球拍 一面是木头 一面是海绵
Beautiful paddle. One side's wood and the other is foam.

2399
01:56:16,390 --> 01:56:19,230
- 嘿 马蒂 怎么样？ - 你好 泰德 你好 劳伦斯
- Hey, Marty, how you doin'? - Hey, Ted. Hey, Lawrence.

2400
01:56:19,240 --> 01:56:20,850
嘿 近来可好？
Aw, damn. Hey, man. How you doin'?

2401
01:56:20,860 --> 01:56:22,680
你看我今晚能住后屋吗？
You think I could stay in the back room tonight?

2402
01:56:22,690 --> 01:56:25,140
- 真不巧 后屋今晚给布赖恩了 - 好吧
- Wow, man. I got Brian staying there tonight. - I get it. All right.

2403
01:56:25,150 --> 01:56:28,110
我真想让你到我家歇 但我老婆不答应
I would let you stay at the house, man, but the wife ain't havin' it.

2404
01:56:28,130 --> 01:56:30,240
没事 我就在这儿晃悠到起飞吧
No, It's all right. I'm just gonna hang around until my flight.

2405
01:56:30,260 --> 01:56:31,410
你要去哪?
Where you goin'?

2406
01:56:31,430 --> 01:56:33,030
去日本 明早八点出发
Going to Japan. Tomorrow morning, 8:00 a.m.

2407
01:56:33,050 --> 01:56:34,780
- 太好了 - 好样的小伙子
- Oh, yeah! - My man!

2408
01:56:34,790 --> 01:56:37,290
- 哟 你真要去啦 弄到钱了 - 是啊 是啊
- Yo, you goin'! You got that money. - Yeah, yeah, yeah.

2409
01:56:37,310 --> 01:56:39,150
祝贺你 小伙计
Good for you, man.

2410
01:56:39,160 --> 01:56:40,860
你表情怎么这么沉啊
You ain't even look like you excited.

2411
01:56:40,870 --> 01:56:43,470
没事 我...挺好的 我挺好的
No, I'm-- I'm good. I'm good.

2412
01:56:43,480 --> 01:56:46,550
你那哥们沃利在后头 他一直在等你
You know your boy back there, Wally, he's been waitin' on you.

2413
01:56:46,570 --> 01:56:47,960
- 沃利在这儿吗？ - 沃利在啊
- Wally's here? - Wally, yeah.

2414
01:56:47,980 --> 01:56:50,380
- 他怎么样？ - 沃利挺好 挺淡定的 伙计
- How'd he seem? - Wally's good. He cool, man.

2415
01:56:50,400 --> 01:56:51,680
他就在里面
He's back there somewhere.

2416
01:56:51,700 --> 01:56:54,990
- 他很看好你 - 当时大家都在掏钱
- He believes in you. - He has a dollar. She has a dollar.

2417
01:56:55,510 --> 01:56:57,770
嘿 你好
Hey. How you doing?

2418
01:56:58,650 --> 01:57:01,010
噢 哇 见到你真好
Oh, wow! How you doing? Nice to see you!

2419
01:57:01,020 --> 01:57:02,600
我一直想联系你
I've been trying to get in touch with you.

2420
01:57:02,620 --> 01:57:05,150
- 真的？ - 是啊 你家狗怎样了 摩西怎么样？
- Oh, really? - Yeah. How's your dog? How's Moses doing?

2421
01:57:05,170 --> 01:57:06,320
能别装了吗？
You wanna cut the bullshit?

2422
01:57:06,340 --> 01:57:08,110
没装 我是真关心那狗的
No bullshit. I'm genuinely concerned about him.

2423
01:57:08,130 --> 01:57:09,690
- 马蒂 马蒂 有麻烦吗？ - 没事 没事
- Marty, Marty, Marty. You good, man? - Yeah, I'm good.

2424
01:57:09,710 --> 01:57:11,740
听着 听着 听着
Now, listen to me. Listen. Listen. Listen.

2425
01:57:11,760 --> 01:57:15,040
你那小妞就在楼下车里 她正等你呢
I got your girl downstairs in the car. She's waiting for you.

2426
01:57:15,060 --> 01:57:17,120
你扯什么呢？你抓了瑞秋？
What the fuck are you telling me? You got Rachel?

2427
01:57:17,140 --> 01:57:18,190
对
Yeah.

2428
01:57:18,200 --> 01:57:21,660
她跟我说狗在新泽西某处 你知道地址
She told me my dog's in Jersey somewhere. And you got the address.

2429
01:57:21,670 --> 01:57:23,120
- 好 - 咱们走
- Okay. - Let's go.

2430
01:57:23,130 --> 01:57:25,670
行吧 好吧 让我...
Okay. All right. Let me, uh...

2431
01:57:25,690 --> 01:57:28,250
额 行吧 让我先...
Um, okay, let me just...

2432
01:57:28,270 --> 01:57:30,870
给我两秒钟 我就跟我哥们说句话
Give me two seconds. I just wanna say one thing to my friend.

2433
01:57:30,880 --> 01:57:33,130
给你两秒钟行 但老子可不等你
Give you two seconds, yeah, but I'm not gonna be here.

2434
01:57:33,150 --> 01:57:35,090
- 不等我你干嘛？ - 我干嘛？
- Where you gonna be? - Where am I gonna be?

2435
01:57:35,110 --> 01:57:38,430
我这就下楼用锤子敲烂她那肚子
I'm gonna be downstairs taking a hammer to your girl's stomach.

2436
01:57:38,450 --> 01:57:39,940
这就是我要干的事
That's where I'm gonna be.

2437
01:57:41,110 --> 01:57:43,570
好 好 好
Okay. All right. All right.

2438
01:57:43,590 --> 01:57:44,970
喂 小毛毛
Yo, Mouse!

2439
01:57:47,020 --> 01:57:49,100
- 走 别磨蹭 - 好吧
- Come on. Let's go. - Okay.

2440
01:57:51,120 --> 01:57:53,950
他的遗产大部分也被我拿了
Well, I took most of his share of the money that our parents left us.

2441
01:57:53,970 --> 01:57:56,450
- 你拿了你弟那份？ - 是的
- You spent your brother's money? - Yes, I did.

2442
01:57:56,470 --> 01:57:57,780
呵 看来你挺疼你弟的
Yeah, you love your brother?

2443
01:57:57,800 --> 01:58:01,080
疼啊 要不你给我弟安排个差事 他人不错
Yeah. Maybe you could give my brother a job. You know he's a good man.

2444
01:58:01,100 --> 01:58:03,380
让他取代你 行了吧？米奇 帮个忙
I'll give him your job, okay? Mitch, do me a favor.

2445
01:58:03,640 --> 01:58:04,640
干嘛？
What?

2446
01:58:04,910 --> 01:58:07,160
闭嘴 行吗？
Stop talking. Okay?

2447
01:58:12,280 --> 01:58:14,330
好了 看到那加油站没？
Okay. See the gas station there?

2448
01:58:15,140 --> 01:58:16,340
往左那个房子就是
it's the house to the left.

2449
01:58:16,350 --> 01:58:17,330
- 前面左转？ - 对
- Next left? - Yeah.

2450
01:58:17,350 --> 01:58:18,350
知道了
I got it.

2451
01:58:37,700 --> 01:58:40,120
下车 赶紧的
Get out of the car. Come on.

2452
01:58:40,680 --> 01:58:41,770
米奇 下来
Mitch, come.

2453
01:58:42,450 --> 01:58:45,460
- 鲁本 你留下看着她 - 好的
- Reuben, you wait with her. - Oh, okay.

2454
01:58:47,470 --> 01:58:48,650
老实坐着
Sit tight.

2455
01:59:06,020 --> 01:59:07,020
快点 使劲敲
Come on. Louder.

2456
01:59:07,680 --> 01:59:08,970
使劲敲
Knock louder.

2457
01:59:14,600 --> 01:59:15,890
那是我的狗
That's my dog.

2458
01:59:16,860 --> 01:59:19,120
摩西 喂
Moses! Yo!

2459
01:59:19,270 --> 01:59:20,390
赶紧开门
Open up!

2460
01:59:21,270 --> 01:59:23,940
真黑 摩西
Fuck. Moses.

2461
01:59:24,880 --> 01:59:27,570
- 开门 - 我讨厌死那狗了
- Come on. - I hate that fuckin' mutt.

2462
01:59:27,590 --> 01:59:29,590
摩西
Moses!

2463
01:59:31,680 --> 01:59:32,890
摩西
Moses!

2464
01:59:33,510 --> 01:59:35,310
那是我的狗 摩西
That's my dog. Moses!

2465
01:59:35,870 --> 01:59:36,870
摩西
Moses!

2466
01:59:37,810 --> 01:59:39,230
里头看见啥没？
See anything in there?

2467
01:59:39,250 --> 01:59:40,580
没 没看到什么
No, not really.

2468
01:59:46,600 --> 01:59:48,270
- 马蒂 - 该死
- Marty! - Shit.

2469
01:59:49,480 --> 01:59:50,980
马蒂 快跑
Marty! Go!

2470
01:59:54,110 --> 01:59:55,480
马蒂
Marty!

2471
02:00:01,280 --> 02:00:02,580
趴下 趴下
Get down! Get down!

2472
02:00:09,150 --> 02:00:10,150
该死
Fuck!

2473
02:00:17,010 --> 02:00:19,630
马蒂 马蒂 我中弹了
Marty! Marty! I got shot!

2474
02:00:19,830 --> 02:00:20,830
救命
Help!

2475
02:00:21,390 --> 02:00:23,430
救命 马蒂 快帮帮我
Help, Marty! Please help!

2476
02:00:23,450 --> 02:00:24,450
帮帮我
Help!

2477
02:00:26,120 --> 02:00:28,790
你没事吧？噢不 你没事吧？
Are you okay? Oh, no! Are you okay?

2478
02:00:28,810 --> 02:00:30,190
- 你没事吧？ - 这他妈是怎么回事？
- Are you okay? - What the fuck's going on?

2479
02:00:30,210 --> 02:00:31,650
好了 没事的
Okay. It's okay.

2480
02:00:31,670 --> 02:00:33,560
我流血了 流血了
I'm bleeding, I'm bleeding.

2481
02:00:33,570 --> 02:00:35,440
好了 没事的 没事的 没事的
Okay. It's okay. It's okay. It's okay.

2482
02:00:40,980 --> 02:00:42,690
- 真对不起 - 对不起
- I'm so sorry. - I'm sorry.

2483
02:00:42,700 --> 02:00:44,020
- 快去拿钱 - 什么钱？
- Go get the money. - What money?

2484
02:00:44,030 --> 02:00:47,070
快去拿钱 就在他口袋里 在他兜里
Go get the money. It's in his pocket. It's in his pocket.

2485
02:00:47,080 --> 02:00:48,160
你确定？
Are you sure?

2486
02:00:48,180 --> 02:00:50,930
- 钱 就在他口袋里 - 好的 知道了 知道了
- The money! It's in the inside pocket! - Okay, okay, okay.

2487
02:01:03,220 --> 02:01:05,140
该死
Oh, fuck.

2488
02:01:12,080 --> 02:01:14,190
这都是什么啊
What is this?

2489
02:01:16,570 --> 02:01:17,860
噢 你个王八蛋...
Oh, you motherfucker...

2490
02:01:33,830 --> 02:01:36,960
好了 好了 没事了 没事了
Okay. Okay. Okay. Okay.

2491
02:01:40,560 --> 02:01:41,810
该死
Fuck!

2492
02:01:44,780 --> 02:01:47,620
放手 你要去哪儿？
Get off me! Where do you think you're going?

2493
02:01:47,630 --> 02:01:48,800
没事的
it's okay.

2494
02:01:50,620 --> 02:01:51,700
好了
Okay.

2495
02:01:53,390 --> 02:01:55,990
- 拿到了吗？拿到了吗？ - 嗯 拿到了 拿到了
- You got it? You got it? - Yeah. I got it, I got it.

2496
02:01:56,000 --> 02:01:57,370
- 钱拿到了吗？ - 嗯 拿到了 拿到了
- You got the money? - Yeah. I got it, I got it.

2497
02:01:57,390 --> 02:01:59,430
- 钱多吗？ - 很多 很多
- Is there a lot of money? - There's a lot.

2498
02:01:59,450 --> 02:02:01,580
- 你能去日本了 - 我知道 你做得真棒
- You can go now. - I know. You did amazing.

2499
02:02:01,600 --> 02:02:03,710
- 你可以去参赛了 - 我就知道你行 太棒了
- You can go on your trip now. - I knew you could do this. So good.

2500
02:02:03,720 --> 02:02:05,150
你帮了大忙
You did such a good job.

2501
02:02:05,170 --> 02:02:07,170
我爱你
I love you.

2502
02:02:07,890 --> 02:02:10,540
- 你预产期什么时候？ - 怎么了？孩子没事吧？
- Honey, when is your due date? - Why? Is the baby okay?

2503
02:02:10,560 --> 02:02:12,820
孩子没事 你得冷静下来
The baby is fine. I just need you to calm down.

2504
02:02:12,830 --> 02:02:14,750
- 你是她丈夫吗？ - 不是 我是她朋友
- Are you the husband? - No. I'm her friend.

2505
02:02:14,770 --> 02:02:16,830
她还有四周就生 孩子会没事吧？
She's due in four weeks. The baby will be okay?

2506
02:02:16,850 --> 02:02:18,430
孩子没事 你不能进了
The baby is okay. It's time to say goodbye.

2507
02:02:18,440 --> 02:02:20,460
- 我不能进？ - 手术室只允许家属进去
- I can't go? - Only family in the operating room.

2508
02:02:20,480 --> 02:02:22,130
不 不 不 不 不
No, no, no, no, no!

2509
02:02:22,150 --> 02:02:24,030
会没事的 瑞秋 都会没事的 放心
It's gonna be fine. Rachel, it's fine. It's fine.

2510
02:02:24,050 --> 02:02:26,090
不 不 不 马蒂 别走
No, no, no! Marty, no.

2511
02:02:26,110 --> 02:02:27,550
他就在外面等着
He'll be right outside.

2512
02:02:27,560 --> 02:02:28,920
马蒂 别走
Marty, no!

2513
02:02:28,930 --> 02:02:30,890
瑞秋 我进不去 他们不让我进
Rachel, I can't go. They're telling me I can't go.

2514
02:02:30,910 --> 02:02:32,480
- 我不想让你... - 冷静下来
- I don't want you to-- - Please calm down.

2515
02:02:32,500 --> 02:02:34,030
- 马蒂 别走 求你别走 - 冷静点
- Marty, don't go, please! - Please try calm down.

2516
02:02:34,040 --> 02:02:36,580
求你别走 马蒂
Please don't go! Marty!

2517
02:02:38,430 --> 02:02:40,180
不要
No!

2518
02:02:48,080 --> 02:02:49,990
罗克韦尔先生 欢迎来到日本 祝您愉快
Thank you very much. Welcome to Japan, Mr. Rockwell.

2519
02:02:50,010 --> 02:02:51,470
- 谢谢 - 谢谢
- Thank you. - Thank you.

2520
02:03:05,040 --> 02:03:07,890
{\an8}（行李领取处）

2521
02:03:16,620 --> 02:03:19,090
{\an8}（日本 东京）

2522
02:03:44,250 --> 02:03:46,960
{\an8}（罗克韦尔 原子笔）

2523
02:03:49,400 --> 02:03:51,470
（日语）好了 下一轮比赛

2524
02:03:51,480 --> 02:03:53,470
（日语）马上就要开始了

2525
02:03:51,480 --> 02:03:54,800
{\an8}（赢一分 得一笔）
（远藤加油 争创佳绩）
（用罗克韦尔书写传奇）

2526
02:03:56,050 --> 02:03:59,260
- （日语）这位挑战者是早川先生 大家掌声欢迎
- （日语）远藤加油

2527
02:04:00,440 --> 02:04:01,930
（日语）你有信心吗？

2528
02:04:02,250 --> 02:04:03,430
（日语）有

2529
02:04:03,510 --> 02:04:05,330
（日语）加油 加油

2530
02:04:05,380 --> 02:04:07,110
（日语）让我们拭目以待

2531
02:04:07,480 --> 02:04:09,810
（日语）那么接下来有请

2532
02:04:09,830 --> 02:04:11,930
（日语）远藤出场

2533
02:04:13,110 --> 02:04:15,920
{\an8}（世界第二 马蒂·毛瑟 最终落败）

2534
02:04:16,060 --> 02:04:17,450
（日语）有点可惜

2535
02:04:17,470 --> 02:04:19,280
- （日语）远藤加油
- （日语）下面请下一位挑战者上场

2536
02:04:19,740 --> 02:04:21,540
毛瑟先生 毛瑟先生
Mr. Mauser. Mr. Mauser.

2537
02:04:21,550 --> 02:04:25,180
罗克韦尔说让你排到最后
Ah. Mr. Rockwell says the back of the line.

2538
02:04:26,040 --> 02:04:28,380
他还不想让你上场
He doesn't want to begin yet.

2539
02:04:37,010 --> 02:04:39,970
{\an8}（挑战者在此排队）

2540
02:04:42,910 --> 02:04:44,510
（日语）这位才11岁...

2541
02:04:51,190 --> 02:04:53,820
{\an8}（世锦赛售票处）

2542
02:04:55,490 --> 02:04:56,500
（日语）谢谢

2543
02:05:03,200 --> 02:05:06,530
- 跟我学 日语管啤酒叫“比鲁” - 来 干杯
- Practice beer "biiru". - Okay, kanpai.

2544
02:05:06,550 --> 02:05:08,610
塞西先生 塞西先生
Mr. Sethi? Mr. Sethi.

2545
02:05:08,620 --> 02:05:10,710
嘿 是我 马蒂·毛瑟
Hey. It's me. It's Marty Mauser.

2546
02:05:10,730 --> 02:05:12,960
你好啊 真没想到能在这碰到您
How you doing? I'm surprised to see you here, actually.

2547
02:05:12,970 --> 02:05:15,060
- 此话怎讲？ - 我不知道 我...
- Why's that? - I don't know. I--

2548
02:05:15,080 --> 02:05:16,370
我们来这里宣传锦标赛
We do have a tournament to promote.

2549
02:05:16,380 --> 02:05:18,130
嗯 当然 当然
No, of course, of course.

2550
02:05:19,000 --> 02:05:20,000
好吧
Yeah.

2551
02:05:20,670 --> 02:05:23,450
我想给您道个歉 伦敦的事
I think I owe you an apology for the way I acted in London.

2552
02:05:23,460 --> 02:05:24,380
那确实不像话
I was a jackass.

2553
02:05:24,400 --> 02:05:26,750
做人要有分寸 毛瑟先生
There is such a thing as a code of courtesy, Mr. Mauser.

2554
02:05:26,760 --> 02:05:28,080
对 我知道 我知道 只是...
No, I know, I know. It's just--

2555
02:05:28,880 --> 02:05:30,300
我出身的环境
It's every man for himself where I come from.

2556
02:05:30,310 --> 02:05:31,930
为了混口饭谁都不讲究 懂吗？
That's just how I grew up. Okay?

2557
02:05:31,950 --> 02:05:33,600
有时候我老毛病也会犯...
And sometimes I feel like I don't even have control--

2558
02:05:33,610 --> 02:05:35,360
我不想听这些借口
I'm really not interested in your excuses.

2559
02:05:35,380 --> 02:05:37,010
不 不 知道 这不是借口
No, no, I know. It's not an excuse.

2560
02:05:37,020 --> 02:05:39,570
我会改掉那些做派
Look, the point is I'm gonna proceed with a much better attitude.

2561
02:05:39,590 --> 02:05:41,680
要是今天我上台表现粗鲁
And by the way, if you see me acting rude up there today,

